(1, '8647296647337', 7, 'https://www.koio.co/products/monza-in-horizon', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Koio', 'Monza Suede Sneaker in Horizon', 'The Monza in Horizon captures the refined spirit of vintage sport through a modern, minimalist lens. Handcrafted in Florence from light grey Italian calf suede and accented with off-white leather “K” details, it delivers a clean, neutral look that feels effortlessly composed. A classic T-toe design nods to retro athletic heritage, while the low-profile natural rubber sole keeps the silhouette sleek and versatile. Elevated yet easy, the Monza in Horizon transitions seamlessly from workdays to weekends — pairing just as naturally with tailored trousers as it does with relaxed denim. Handcrafted in Florence, Italy Constructed from Italian calf suede with leather accents Lined with Italian calf nappa leather Set on a stitched Italian 100% rubber sole for lasting traction Designed with a soft tongue for enhanced comfort Fitted with a removable OrthoLite® Hybrid™ insole Threaded with premium waxed laces ::Tab:: LWG-certified leather: This sneaker is made from leathers that are certified by the Leather Working Group (LWG), meaning they’re responsibly tanned in facilities that safely and carefully manage emissions, energy and water consumption, and waste. FSC®-certified natural rubber: 50% of this sneaker’s sole is Forest Stewardship Council®-certified (FSC®) natural rubber. This certification ensures the rubber is sourced from a forest that’s responsibly managed to prevent deforestation. Recycled materials: 40% of this sneaker’s sole is recycled rubber. It also has an OrthoLite® Hybrid insole made with recycled foam and rubber from previous production processes. ::Tab:: Fits true to size. Take your normal US size Only available in full sizes. Go down to the nearest whole size if you wear a half size. Width D - Standard Unsure of your size? Reach out to our team for a recommendation .', 265.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0646/1285/files/Monza-V2-horizon-1.jpg?v=1756212449', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Rubber', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Sneaker en cuir italien, design classique, semelle en caoutchouc', 1, 76.5789, 0, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Liam\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-35\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain actif\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"independant\",\n      \"ambitieux\",\n      \"éclectique\",\n      \"appreciate la qualité\",\n      \"conscient de l\'environnement\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"sorties avec les amis\",\n      \"événements sportifs\",\n      \"week-ends en ville\",\n      \"rendez-vous romantiques\",\n      \"journées de shopping\"\n   ]\n}', 0.137711, -0.101844, 76.5919),
(2, '8804035788969', 7, 'https://www.koio.co/products/capri-leather-sneaker-in-terra', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Koio', 'Capri Leather Sneaker in Terra', 'The Capri in Terra is an elegant sneaker handcrafted in Italy from luxurious deep caramel leather—almost brown in tone—bringing rich warmth and effortless sophistication to your everyday style. Set on a cream rubber sole and equipped with an Ortholite tech-foam insole, it blends versatility with modern refinement. Pair it effortlessly with denim and an overshirt or complement tailored pieces with a lightweight blazer for a polished, understated look. Handmade in Tuscany, Italy Constructed from Italian calf leather Lined with Italian calf leather Set on a 100% rubber sole (50% natural, 40% recycled, 10% conventional) Tightly stitched for water resistance Threaded with waxed cotton laces Fitted with a removable OrthoLite® Hybrid™ insole ::Tab:: LWG-certified leather: This sneaker is lined with leather that’s certified by the Leather Working Group (LWG), meaning it’s responsibly tanned in a facility that safely and carefully manages emissions, energy and water consumption, and waste. FSC®-certified natural rubber: 50% of this sneaker’s sole is Forest Stewardship Council®-certified (FSC®) natural rubber. This certification ensures the rubber is sourced from a forest that’s responsibly managed to prevent deforestation. Recycled materials: 40% of this sneaker’s sole is recycled rubber. It also has an OrthoLite® Hybrid insole made with recycled foam and rubber from previous production processes. ::Tab:: Fits true to size. Take your normal US size Only available in full sizes. Go down to the nearest whole size if you wear a half size. Width D - Standard Width can be adjusted by tightening/loosening the laces. Unsure of your size? Reach out to our team for a recommendation .', 265.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0646/1285/files/Capri-V2-terra-1.jpg?v=1771591601', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-