(3, '8804035756201', 7, 'https://www.koio.co/products/capri-suede-sneaker-in-indigo', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Koio', 'Capri Suede Sneaker in Indigo', 'The Capri in Indigo is an elegant sneaker handcrafted in Italy from luxurious deep blue suede sourced from Chiampo Valley in Vicenza. Set on a cream rubber sole and equipped with an Ortholite tech-foam insole, it blends versatility with modern refinement. Pair it comfortably with jeans and a soft sweater, or sharpen tailored ensembles like trousers and a lightweight blazer. Handmade in Tuscany, Italy Constructed from Italian calf suede Lined with Italian calf leather Set on a 100% rubber sole (50% natural, 40% recycled, 10% conventional) Tightly stitched for water resistance Threaded with waxed cotton laces Fitted with a removable OrthoLite® Hybrid™ insole ::Tab:: LWG-certified leather: This sneaker is lined with leather that’s certified by the Leather Working Group (LWG), meaning it’s responsibly tanned in a facility that safely and carefully manages emissions, energy and water consumption, and waste. FSC®-certified natural rubber: 50% of this sneaker’s sole is Forest Stewardship Council®-certified (FSC®) natural rubber. This certification ensures the rubber is sourced from a forest that’s responsibly managed to prevent deforestation. Recycled materials: 40% of this sneaker’s sole is recycled rubber. It also has an OrthoLite® Hybrid insole made with recycled foam and rubber from previous production processes. ::Tab:: Fits true to size. Take your normal US size Only available in full sizes. Go down to the nearest whole size if you wear a half size. Width D - Standard Width can be adjusted by tightening/loosening the laces. Unsure of your size? Reach out to our team for a recommendation .', 265.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0646/1285/files/Capri-V2-indigo-1.jpg?v=1771591504', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Toile', 'Rubber', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Sneaker en toile italienne, design élégant, semelle en caoutchouc', 1, 76.5789, 0, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": {\n      \"vêtements\": \"tenue urbaine\",\n      \"chaussures\": \"sneakers\",\n      \"accessoires\": \"montres, lunettes de soleil\"\n   },\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"confiance\": \"élevée\",\n      \"influence\": \"moyenne\",\n      \"originalité\": \"élevée\",\n      \"conformisme\": \"faible\"\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"jour\": \"sorties avec les amis, week-end\",\n      \"soir\": \"dîners, sorties en ville\"\n   }\n}', 0.0355118, -0.253963, 76.5919),
(4, '7531975180457', 7, 'https://www.koio.co/products/capri-mid-in-nero-mens', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Koio', 'Capri Mid Leather Sneaker in Nero', 'The Capri Mid in Nero refines our signature silhouette with a higher cut that delivers added ankle support and seasonal versatility. Handcrafted in Tuscany from supple full-grain black calf leather, it’s grounded by a tonal stitched rubber sole for a sleek, uninterrupted profile. Designed to feel effortless from day one, it’s a shoe you’ll reach for on colder days or when you want a bit more structure—equally sharp with denim, tailored trousers, or layered winter fits. Handmade in Tuscany, Italy Constructed from premium Italian full-grain calf leather Lined with Italian calf leather for lasting comfort Set on a stitched 100% rubber sole (50% natural, 40% recycled, 10% conventional) Tightly stitched for water resistance Threaded with waxed cotton laces Fitted with a removable OrthoLite® Hybrid™ insole Finished with hand-painted edges for refined detail ::Tab:: LWG-certified leather: This sneaker is made from leathers that are certified by the Leather Working Group (LWG), meaning they’re responsibly tanned in facilities that safely and carefully manage emissions, energy and water consumption, and waste. FSC®-certified natural rubber: 50% of this sneaker’s sole is Forest Stewardship Council®-certified (FSC®) natural rubber. This certification ensures the rubber is sourced from a forest that’s responsibly managed to prevent deforestation. Recycled materials: 40% of this sneaker’s sole is recycled rubber. It also has an OrthoLite® Hybrid insole made with recycled foam and rubber from previous production processes. ::Tab:: Size one whole size down. Please refer to our Size Guide. Only available in full sizes. Go down to the nearest whole size if you wear a half size. Width D - Standard Width can be adjusted by tightening/loosening the laces. Not sure of your size? Reach out to our team for a recommendation . Shaft height 3.9 in/ 10 cm Please note that measurements may vary by size Product Measurements based on a size US 09', 295.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0646/1285/files/Capri-Mid-V2-nero-1_e89ed65d-dcb0-4d8e-bd5c-b7e29f070caf.jpg?v=1757516948', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Rubber', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Sneaker en cuir italien, design élégant, semelle en caoutchouc', 1, 75, 0, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Lorenzo Bianchi\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": {\n      \"activite\": \"urbain\",\n      \"loisirs\": \"musique, cinéma\",\n      \"mode_transport\": \"marche, vélo\"\n   },\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"conformiste\": false,\n      \"innovant\": true,\n      \"écologique\": true\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"journee_travail\": true,\n      \"sortie_nuit\": false,\n      \"activite_physique\": true\n   }\n}', 0.137711, -0.101844, 75.0013),
