(8, '8176446701737', 7, 'https://www.koio.co/products/capri-in-nero-wide-fit', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Koio', 'Capri Leather Sneaker in Nero Wide Fit', 'The Capri in Nero is a sophisticated sneaker handcrafted in Italy from premium full-grain black leather, set on a sleek all-black rubber sole. Fitted with an Ortholite tech-foam insole, it delivers understated luxury and comfort. Pair effortlessly with black jeans and a charcoal sweater, or elevate your look with tailored grey trousers and a black blazer. Handmade in Tuscany, Italy Constructed from LWG-certified Italian leather (Cow) Lined with LWG-certified Italian leather (Cow) Set on a natural (50%), recycled (40%) and conventional (10%) rubber sole Tightly stitched for water resistance Threaded with waxed cotton laces Fitted with a removable OrthoLite® Hybrid™ insole Finished with hand-painted edges ::Tab:: LWG-certified leather: This sneaker is made from leathers that are certified by the Leather Working Group (LWG), meaning they’re responsibly tanned in facilities that safely and carefully manage emissions, energy and water consumption, and waste. FSC®-certified natural rubber: 50% of this sneaker’s sole is Forest Stewardship Council®-certified (FSC®) natural rubber. This certification ensures the rubber is sourced from a forest that’s responsibly managed to prevent deforestation. Recycled materials: 40% of this sneaker’s sole is recycled rubber. It also has an OrthoLite® Hybrid insole made with recycled foam and rubber from previous production processes. ::Tab:: Fits true to size. Take your normal US size Only available in full sizes. Go down to the nearest whole size if you wear a half size. Width E - Wide. If you usually wear width EE or wider, this model might be too narrow for you. Width can be adjusted by tightening/loosening the laces. Unsure of your size? Reach out to our team for a recommendation .', 265.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'out_of_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0646/1285/files/Capri-V2-nero