(9, '8647296581801', 7, 'https://www.koio.co/products/lido-in-ivory', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Koio', 'Lido Suede Loafer in Ivory', 'Effortless refinement for every occasion. The Lido in Ivory is handcrafted in Florence from premium Italian calf suede in a soft, neutral tone. Its clean silhouette rests on a lightweight Cassetta sole for sneaker-level comfort, while moc-toe stitching and hand-finished details lend a quiet sophistication. Styled with khaki trousers and a navy quarter-zip, it strikes the perfect balance between polish and ease—made to carry you from a late-morning coffee to an early-evening dinner with confidence. Handmade in Florence, Italy Constructed from Italian calf suede Lined with Italian calf leather Set on a 100% rubber Casetta sole (50% natural, 40% recycled, 10% conventional) Fitted with a removable OrthoLite® Hybrid™ insole ::Tab:: LWG-certified suede & leather: This sneaker is made from suedes and leathers that are certified by the Leather Working Group (LWG), meaning they’re responsibly tanned in facilities that safely and carefully manage emissions, energy and water consumption, and waste. FSC®-certified natural rubber: 50% of this sneaker’s sole is Forest Stewardship Council®-certified (FSC®) natural rubber. This certification ensures the rubber is sourced from a forest that’s responsibly managed to prevent deforestation. Recycled materials: 40% of this sneaker’s sole is recycled rubber. It also has an OrthoLite® Hybrid insole made with recycled foam and rubber from previous production processes. ::Tab:: Fits true to size. Take your normal US size Only available in full sizes. Go down to the nearest whole size if you wear a half size. Width D - Standard Unsure of your size? Reach out to our team for a recommendation .', 265.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0646/1285/files/Lido-V2-ivory-1.jpg?v=1757517424', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Toile', 'Cassetta', 'Slip-on', 