(10, '7559510720681', 7, 'https://www.koio.co/products/primo-in-nero-mens', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Koio', 'Primo Leather Sneaker in Nero', 'Versatile all-black leather for every cool-weather situation. The Primo—Koio’s first-ever sneaker—returns for the 10-year anniversary. Crafted in Tuscany from premium Italian pebbled calf leather, it balances the refined polish of a boot with the ease of a sneaker. The cushioned ankle collar and 8-grommet lacing provide a close, comfortable fit, while the full black leather lining and tonal sole create a clean, modern finish. Wear it with black denim and a wool overshirt, straight-leg pants and a turtleneck, or joggers and a bomber for an effortless edge. Handmade in Tuscany, Italy Constructed from Italian pebbled calf leather Fully lined in black Italian calf leather Cushioned ankle collar and padded tongue for comfort 8-grommet lacing system for a secure fit Set on a stitched Italian 100% rubber sole for lasting traction Fitted with a removable OrthoLite® Hybrid™ insole Finished with waxed cotton laces ::Tab:: LWG-certified leather: This sneaker is lined with leather that’s certified by the Leather Working Group (LWG), meaning it’s responsibly tanned in a facility that safely and carefully manages emissions, energy and water consumption, and waste. FSC®-certified natural rubber: 50% of this sneaker’s sole is Forest Stewardship Council®-certified (FSC®) natural rubber. This certification ensures the rubber is sourced from a forest that’s responsibly managed to prevent deforestation. Recycled materials: 40% of this sneaker’s sole is recycled rubber. It also has an OrthoLite® Hybrid insole made with recycled foam and rubber from previous production processes. ::Tab:: Fits true to size. Take your normal US size. Only available in full sizes. Go down to the nearest whole size if you wear a half size. Width D - Standard Width can be adjusted by tightening/loosening the laces. Not sure of your size? Reach out to our team for a recommendation . Shaft height 4.7 in/ 12 cm Please note that measurements may vary by size Product Measurements based on a size US 09', 325.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'out_of_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0646/1285/files/Primo-V2-nero-1.jpg?v=1757679206', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Rubber', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Sneaker en cuir italien, design élégant, semelle en caoutchouc', 1, 73.4211, 0, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Lorenzo Bianchi\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain, tendance, actif\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"confiant\",\n      \"independent\",\n      \"passionné par la mode\",\n      \"appreciate la qualité\",\n      \"préoccupé par l\'environnement\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"sorties nocturnes\",\n      \"événements sportifs\",\n      \"rendez-vous amicaux\",\n      \"voyages de week-end\",\n      \"journées de shopping\"\n   ]\n}', 0.137711, -0.101844, 72.2005),
(11, '7531975311529', 7, 'https://www.koio.co/products/capri-mid-in-triple-white-mens', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Koio', 'Capri Mid Leather Sneaker in Triple White', 'The Capri Mid in Triple White elevates our signature sneaker with a higher silhouette designed for greater support and protection. Handcrafted in Tuscany from smooth white calf leather, it offers added ankle coverage that shields against the elements while maintaining a clean, minimalist profile. Set on a tonal stitched rubber sole, it delivers lasting comfort and timeless versatility—easy to pair with tailored looks in summer or layered fits through colder months. Handmade in Tuscany, Italy Constructed from premium Italian full-grain calf leather Lined with Italian calf leather for lasting comfort Set on a stitched 100% rubber sole (50% natural, 40% recycled, 10% conventional) Tightly stitched for water resistance Threaded with waxed cotton laces Fitted with a removable OrthoLite® Hybrid™ insole Finished with hand-painted edges for refined detail ::Tab:: LWG-certified leather: This sneaker is made from leathers that are Gold and certified by the Leather Working Group (LWG), meaning they’re responsibly tanned in facilities that safely and carefully manage emissions, energy and water consumption, and waste. FSC®-certified natural rubber: 50% of this sneaker’s sole is Forest Stewardship Council®-certified (FSC®) natural rubber. This certification ensures the rubber is sourced from a forest that’s responsibly managed to prevent deforestation. Recycled materials: 40% of this sneaker’s sole is recycled rubber. It also has an OrthoLite® Hybrid insole made with recycled foam and rubber from previous production processes. ::Tab:: Size one whole size down. Please refer to our Size Guide. Only available in full sizes. Go down to the nearest whole size if you wear a half size. Width D - Standard Width can be adjusted by tightening/loosening the laces. Not sure of your size? Reach out to our team for a recommendation . Shaft height 3.9 in/ 10 cm Please note that measurements may vary by size Product Measurements based on a size US 09', 295.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'out_of_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0646/1285/files/Capri-Mid-V2-triple-white-1.jpg?v=1757518685', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Rubber', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Sneaker en cuir italien, design élégant, semelle en caoutchouc', 1, 75, 0, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Léo Dupont\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-35\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain, tendance, actif\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"confiance\": 8,\n      \"originalité\": 9,\n      \"éclectisme\": 7,\n      \"responsabilité\": 6,\n      \"authenticité\": 9\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"jour\": {\n         \"travail\": 4,\n         \"sortie avec amis\": 3,\n         \"shopping\": 2,\n         \"autres\": 1\n      },\n      \"soir\": {\n         \"sortie en ville\": 5,\n         \"dîner en boîte\": 4,\n         \"événement\": 3,\n         \"autres\": 2\n      }\n   }\n}', 0.137711, -0.101844, 75.0013),
(12, '8547690709161', 7, 'https://www.koio.co/products/capri-in-tundra', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Koio', 'Capri Leather Sneaker in Tundra', 'The Capri in Tundra offers a muted, modern taupe leather that embodies versatility and refinement. Handcrafted in Tuscany from premium Italian calf leather, it balances understated sophistication with all-day wearability. Its neutral tone makes it a seamless anchor in any wardrobe—effortlessly styled with cream trousers and a navy knit, or denim and a casual overshirt. Built to last, Tundra is a timeless essential. Handmade in Tuscany, Italy Constructed from Italian calf leather Lined with Italian calf leather Set on a 100% rubber sole (50% natural, 40% recycled, 10% conventional) Tightly stitched for water resistance Threaded with waxed cotton laces Fitted with a removable OrthoLite® Hybrid™ insole Finished with hand-painted edge ::Tab:: LWG-certified leather: This sneaker is made from leathers that are certified by the Leather Working Group (LWG), meaning they’re responsibly tanned in facilities that safely and carefully manage emissions, energy and water consumption, and waste. FSC®-certified natural rubber: 50% of this sneaker’s sole is Forest Stewardship Council®-certified (FSC®) natural rubber. This certification ensures the rubber is sourced from a forest that’s responsibly managed to prevent deforestation. Recycled materials: 40% of this sneaker’s sole is recycled rubber. It also has an OrthoLite® Hybrid insole made with recycled foam and rubber from previous production processes. ::Tab:: Fits true to size. Take your normal US size Only available in full sizes. Go down to the nearest whole size if you wear a half size. Width D - Standard Width can be adjusted by tightening/loosening the laces. Unsure of your size? Reach out to our team for a recommendation .', 265.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0646/1285/files/Capri-V2-tundra-1.jpg?v=1753969799', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-03-24 16:31: