(13, '7459543482537', 7, 'https://www.koio.co/products/capri-avorio-womens', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Koio', 'Capri Leather & Suede Sneaker in Avorio', 'The Capri in Avorio is handcrafted from LWG-certified Italian leather and detailed with buttery light-grey suede at the heel for a soft contrast. It\'s set on a partially recycled rubber sole to ensure a comfortable fit. Handmade in Tuscany, Italy Constructed from LWG-certified Italian calf leather and suede Lined with LWG-certified Italian calf leather Set on a 100% rubber sole (50% natural, 40% recycled, 10% conventional) Tightly stitched for water resistance Threaded with waxed cotton laces Fitted with a removable OrthoLite® Hybrid™ insole Finished with hand-painted edges ::Tab:: LWG-certified leather & suede: This sneaker is made from leathers and suedes that are certified by the Leather Working Group (LWG), meaning they’re responsibly tanned in facilities that safely and carefully manage emissions, energy and water consumption, and waste. FSC®-certified natural rubber: 50% of this sneaker’s sole is Forest Stewardship Council®-certified (FSC®) natural rubber. This certification ensures the rubber is sourced from a forest that’s responsibly managed to prevent deforestation. Recycled materials: 40% of this sneaker’s sole is recycled rubber. It also has an OrthoLite® Hybrid insole made with recycled foam and rubber from previous production processes. ::Tab:: Fits true to size. Take your normal US size Only available in full sizes. Go down to the nearest whole size if you wear a half size. Width B - Standard Width can be adjusted by tightening/loosening the laces. Unsure of your size? Reach out to our team for a recommendation .', 265.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'out_of_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0646/1285/files/Capri-V2-avorio-1-min_24dd192f-f8ec-4ddf-86b1-cc246882df8e.jpg?v=1762198392', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir et Toile', 'Rubber', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Sneaker en cuir et toile italiennes, design élégant, semelle en caoutchouc', 1, 76.5789, 0, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Léa Dupont\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain chic\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"independante\",\n      \"tendance\",\n      \"éclectique\",\n      \"appreciative de la qualité\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"sorties nocturnes\",\n      \"rendez-vous amicaux\",\n      \"week-ends en ville\",\n      \"événements de mode\"\n   ]\n}', 0.0405128, -0.181675, 76.5919),
(14, '7318292136105', 7, 'https://www.koio.co/products/capri-castagna-mens-1', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Koio', 'Capri Leather Sneaker in Castagna', 'The Capri in Castagna is an elevated sneaker handcrafted in Italy from vegetable-tanned brown leather that develops a rich patina over time. Featuring an Ortholite tech-foam insole and natural rubber outsole, it blends comfort with heritage appeal. Wear casually with navy chinos and a white polo or elevate your look with beige trousers and a navy blazer. Important information : Our Castagna leather is a vegetable-tanned premium Italian leather. Thanks to this tanning method and the hand-polishing, it attains a unique depth and sheen. It will age gracefully and change its appearance slightly over time. Given the natural tanning process, you can expect variations from the images shown. These variations are a result of the manufacturing process and a testament to the high-quality craftsmanship we pursue. Handmade in Tuscany, Italy Constructed from vegetable-tanned Italian calf leather Lined with Italian calf leather Set on a 100% rubber sole (50% natural, 40% recycled, 10% conventional) Tightly stitched for water resistance Threaded with waxed cotton laces Fitted with a removable OrthoLite® Hybrid™ insole Finished with hand-painted edges There may be slight variations in color or pattern from the images shown due to the material being vegetable-tanned ::Tab:: LWG-certified leather: This sneaker is lined with leather that’s certified by the Leather Working Group (LWG), meaning it’s responsibly tanned in a facility that safely and carefully manages emissions, energy and water consumption, and waste. FSC®-certified natural rubber: 50% of this sneaker’s sole is Forest Stewardship Council®-certified (FSC®) natural rubber. This certification ensures the rubber is sourced from a forest that’s responsibly managed to prevent deforestation. Recycled materials: 40% of this sneaker’s sole is recycled rubber. It also has an OrthoLite® Hybrid insole made with recycled foam and rubber from previous production processes. ::Tab:: Fits true to size. Take your normal US size Only available in full sizes. Go down to the nearest whole size if you wear a half size. Width D - Standard Width can be adjusted by tightening/loosening the laces. Unsure of your size? Reach out to our team for a recommendation .', 265.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0646/1285/files/Capri-V2-castagna-1.jpg?v=1762198281', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Rubber', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Sneaker en cuir italien, design élégant, semelle en caoutchouc', 1, 76.5789, 0, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Liam Cooper\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain-chic\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": true,\n      \"influencé par la mode\": true,\n      \"apprécie la qualité\": true,\n      \"préfère les marques de niche\": true\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"journées de travail\": true,\n      \"sorties nocturnes\": true,\n      \"activités sportives\": true,\n      \"rendez-vous amicaux\": true\n   }\n}', 0.137711, -0.101844, 76.5919),
(15, '8498594840745', 7, 'https://www.koio.co/products/care-bundle-for-leather', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Koio', 'Care Bundle For Leather I KOIO', 'Give your leather Koios the care they deserve with this essential maintenance set — designed to clean, protect, and preserve. Includes: Shoe Tree – Crafted from cedar wood, it helps maintain the shape and structure of your Koios. Eco-Cleaner – Effectively removes stubborn stains and scuffs from leather surfaces. Eco-Protect – Creates a water-resistant barrier and helps prevent stains. Microfiber Cloth – Keeps your Koios clean and dry, helping to prevent long-term damage.', 66.50, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0646/1285/files/Leather-Bundle.jpg?v=1762269059', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Inconnu', 'Inconnu', 'Inconnu', 'inconnu', 'Kit de soin pour chaussures en cuir', 1, 87.0263, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": {\n      \"activite\": \"urbaine\",\n      \"loisirs\": [\"musique\", \"cinéma\", \"voyages\"],\n      \"mode_de_vie\": \"urbain\"\n   },\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": true,\n      \"independent\": true,\n      \"conscientieux\": true,\n      \"décontracté\": true\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"journee_travail\": true,\n      \"sortie_nuit\": true,\n      \"voyage\": true,\n      \"activite_physique\": true\n   }\n}', -0.1395, -0.202413, 86.9487),
(16, '8383432884393', 7, 'https://www.koio.co/products/lido-in-yacht', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Koio', 'Lido Nubuck Loafer in Yacht', 'The Lido in Yacht is a sleek loafer handcrafted in Florence from premium navy nubuck. It fuses traditional craftsmanship with a streamlined, understated silhouette. Supported by a lightweight Cassetta sole for sneaker-like comfort, it features moc toe stitching, a softly structured tongue, and refined hand-stitched side detailing. Elegant and understated with a bit of an edge, it pairs effortlessly with light chinos and a white button-down or denim and a relaxed sweater. Handmade in Florence, Italy Constructed from Italian calf nubuck Lined with Italian calf leather Set on a 100% rubber Casetta sole (50% natural, 40% recycled, 10% conventional) Fitted with a removable OrthoLite® Hybrid™ insole ::Tab:: LWG-certified suede & leather: This sneaker is made from suedes and leathers that are certified by the Leather Working Group (LWG), meaning they’re responsibly tanned in facilities that safely and carefully manage emissions, energy and water consumption, and waste. FSC®-certified natural rubber: 50% of this sneaker’s sole is Forest Stewardship Council®-certified (FSC®) natural rubber. This certification ensures the rubber is sourced from a forest that’s responsibly managed to prevent deforestation. Recycled materials: 40% of this sneaker’s sole is recycled rubber. It also has an OrthoLite® Hybrid insole made with recycled foam and rubber from previous production processes. ::Tab:: Fits true to size. Take your normal US size Only available in full sizes. Go down to the nearest whole size if you wear a half size. Width D - Standard Unsure of your size? Reach out to our team for a recommendation .', 265.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'out_of_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0646/1285/files/Lido-V2-yacht-1_72b62c19-c2f8-457f-bee5-67bf1ef0c80d.jpg?v=1762268815', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Toile', 'Casse