(18, '7711839551657', 7, 'https://www.koio.co/products/capri-mocha-wide-fit-mens', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Koio', 'Capri Leather Sneaker in Mocha Wide Fit', 'Handmade in Tuscany, Italy Constructed from vegetable-tanned Italian leather (Cow) Brushed with a blend of waxes and oils that impart a velvety sheen Lined with LWG Silver-certified Italian leather (Cow) Set on a natural (50%), recycled (40%) and conventional (10%) rubber sole Tightly stitched for water resistance Threaded with waxed cotton laces Fitted with a removable OrthoLite® Hybrid™ insole Finished with hand-painted edges ::Tab:: LWG Silver-certified leather: This sneaker is lined with leather that’s Silver-certified by the Leather Working Group (LWG), meaning it’s responsibly tanned in a facility that safely and carefully manages emissions, energy and water consumption, and waste. FSC®-certified natural rubber: 50% of this sneaker’s sole is Forest Stewardship Council®-certified (FSC®) natural rubber. This certification ensures the rubber is sourced from a forest that’s responsibly managed to prevent deforestation. Recycled materials: 40% of this sneaker’s sole is recycled rubber. It also has an OrthoLite® Hybrid insole made with recycled foam and rubber from previous production processes. ::Tab:: Fits true to size. Take your normal US size Only available in full sizes. Go down to the nearest whole size if you wear a half size. Width E - Wide. If you usually wear width EE or wider, this model might be too narrow for you. Width can be adjusted by tightening/loosening the laces. Unsure of your size? Reach out to our team for a recommendation .', 265.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'out_of_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0646/1285/files/Capri-V2-mocha-1-min_0bb31a3f-d7f-4df8-bd54-b15af0f10507.jpg?v=1762198618', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Rubber', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Sneaker en cuir italien, design élégant, semelle en caoutchouc', 1, 76.5789, 0, '{\n  \"nom_pers