(19, '7414678749353', 7, 'https://www.koio.co/products/capri-sandstone-womens', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Koio', 'Capri Leather Sneaker in Sandstone', 'The Capri in ‘Sandstone’ is handcrafted from the same LWG Gold-certified leather as our much-loved Capri in ‘Nuvola,’ but it has smooth leather at the ankle instead of suede. It’s outfitted with a tonal rubber sole and threaded with waxed cotton laces. You’ll love how versatile the warm, greyish-beige hue is. Handmade in Tuscany, Italy Constructed from LWG-certified Italian calf leather Lined with LWG-certified Italian calf leather Set on a partially recycled, partially natural rubber sole Tightly stitched for water resistance Threaded with waxed cotton laces Fitted with a removable OrthoLite® Hybrid™ insole Finished with hand-painted edges ::Tab:: LWG-certified leather: This sneaker is made from leathers that are certified by the Leather Working Group (LWG), meaning they’re responsibly tanned in facilities that safely and carefully manage emissions, energy and water consumption, and waste. FSC®-certified natural rubber: 50% of this sneaker’s sole is Forest Stewardship Council®-certified (FSC®) natural rubber. This certification ensures the rubber is sourced from a forest that’s responsibly managed to prevent deforestation. Recycled materials: 40% of this sneaker’s sole is recycled rubber. It also has an OrthoLite® Hybrid insole made with recycled foam and rubber from previous production processes. ::Tab:: Fits true to size. Take your normal US size Only available in full sizes. Go down to the nearest whole size if you wear a half size. Width B - Standard Width can be adjusted by tightening/loosening the laces. Unsure of your size? Reach out to our team for a recommendation .', 265.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0646/1285/files/Capri-V2-sandstone-1-min_a797c9e0-94d1-411e-b580-3423a3f78f2e.jpg?v=1762198365', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Rubber', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Sneaker en cuir italien, design élégant, semelle en caoutchouc', 1, 76.5789, 0, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"independent\",\n      \"tendance\",\n      \"actif\",\n      \"éclectique\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"sortie avec des amis\",\n      \"rendez-vous\",\n      \"week-end en ville\",\n      \"événement sportif\"\n   ]\n}', 0.137711, -0.101844, 76.5919),
(20, '7443357860009', 7, 'https://www.koio.co/products/capri-nero-womens', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Koio', 'Capri Leather Sneaker in Nero', 'The Capri in Nero is an all-black colorway that looks so sleek. Handcrafted in Italy from buttery full-grain leather, it\'s set on a rubber sole that delivers durability and comfort. Handmade in Tuscany, Italy Constructed from LWG-certified Italian calf leather Lined with LWG-certified Italian calf leather Set on a 100% rubber sole (50% natural, 40% recycled, 10% conventional) Tightly stitched for water resistance Threaded with waxed cotton laces Fitted with a removable OrthoLite® Hybrid™ insole Finished with hand-painted edges ::Tab:: LWG-certified leather: This sneaker is made from leathers that are certified by the Leather Working Group (LWG), meaning they’re responsibly tanned in facilities that safely and carefully manage emissions, energy and water consumption, and waste. FSC®-certified natural rubber: 50% of this sneaker’s sole is Forest Stewardship Council®-certified (FSC®) natural rubber. This certification ensures the rubber is sourced from a forest that’s responsibly managed to prevent deforestation. Recycled materials: 40% of this sneaker’s sole is recycled rubber. It also has an OrthoLite® Hybrid insole made with recycled foam and rubber from previous production processes. ::Tab:: Fits true to size. Take your normal US size Only available in full sizes. Go down to the nearest whole size if you wear a half size. Width B - Standard Width can be adjusted by tightening/loosening the laces. Unsure of your size? Reach out to our team for a recommendation .', 265.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0646/1285/files/Capri-V2-nero-1-min.jpg?v=1762198382', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Rubber', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Sneaker en cuir italien, design élégant, semelle en caoutchouc', 1, 76.5789, 0, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Lorenzo Bianchi\",\n   \"age_cible