(24, '7448238031017', 7, 'https://www.koio.co/products/capri-triple-white-wide-fit', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Koio', 'Capri Leather Sneaker in Triple White Wide Fit', 'Gear Patrol Style Awards 2023 Best Overall Leather Sneaker Handmade in Tuscany, Italy Constructed from LWG Gold-certified Italian leather (Cow) Lined with LWG Silver-certified Italian leather (Cow) Set on a 100% rubber sole (50% natural, 40% recycled, 10% conventional) Tightly stitched for water resistance Threaded with waxed cotton laces Fitted with a removable OrthoLite® Hybrid™ insole Finished with hand-painted edges ::Tab:: LWG audited leather: This sneaker’s leather upper is sourced from an Italian tannery that has been audited by the Leather Working Group (LWG). Due to a high-volume of applicants for LWG audits and certifications, this tannery has not yet received its sustainability rating. LWG Silver-certified leather: This sneaker is lined with leather that’s Silver-certified by the Leather Working Group (LWG), meaning it’s responsibly tanned in a facility that safely and carefully manages emissions, energy and water consumption, and waste. FSC®-certified natural rubber: 50% of this sneaker’s sole is Forest Stewardship Council®-certified (FSC®) natural rubber. This certification ensures the rubber is sourced from a forest that’s responsibly managed to prevent deforestation. Recycled materials: 40% of this sneaker’s sole is recycled rubber. It also has an OrthoLite® Hybrid insole made with recycled foam and rubber from previous production processes. ::Tab:: Fits true to size. Take your normal US size Only available in full sizes. Go down to the nearest whole size if you wear a half size. Width E - Wide. If you usually wear width EE or wider, this model might be too narrow for you. Width can be adjusted by tightening/loosening the laces. Unsure of your size? Reach out to our team for a recommendation .', 265.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0646/1285/files/Capri-V2-triple-white-1-min_94c82d7a-8647-4c2c-9c40-dca56fc0f25b.jpg?v=1762198387', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Caoutchouc', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Sneaker durable et résistant à l\'eau', 1, 76.5789, 2, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Liam\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": {\n      \"activite\": \"urbaine\",\n      \"loisirs\": \"musique, cinéma, restauration\",\n      \"mode_de_vie\": \"urbain, dynamique\"\n   },\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"confiance\": \"élevée\",\n      \"ouverture\": \"ouvert\",\n      \"influence\": \"moyenne\"\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"journee_travail\": \"occasionnel\",\n      \"sortie_nuit\": \"fréquent\",\n      \"activite_physique\": \"occasionnel\",\n      \"événement_social\": \"fréquent\"\n   }\n}', 0.460434, -0.413131, 76.5919),
