(26, '7455068094633', 7, 'https://www.koio.co/products/capri-charcoal-men-1', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Koio', 'Capri Nubuck Sneaker in Charcoal', 'The Capri in Charcoal is a versatile sneaker handcrafted in Italy from dark-grey nubuck sourced from Chiampo Valley in Vicenza. Set on a tonal rubber sole and fitted with an Ortholite tech-foam insole, it offers sophisticated refinement. Pair effortlessly with black joggers and a grey fitted sweater, or sharpen tailored ensembles like charcoal trousers and a navy blazer. Handmade in Tuscany, Italy Constructed from Italian calf nubuck Lined with Italian calf leather Set on a 100% rubber sole (50% natural, 40% recycled, 10% conventional) Tightly stitched for water resistance Threaded with waxed cotton laces Fitted with a removable OrthoLite® Hybrid™ insole Finished with hand-painted edges ::Tab:: LWG-certified nubuck & leather: This sneaker is made from nubucks and leathers that are certified by the Leather Working Group (LWG), meaning they’re responsibly tanned in facilities that safely and carefully manage emissions, energy and water consumption, and waste. FSC®-certified natural rubber: 50% of this sneaker’s sole is Forest Stewardship Council®-certified (FSC®) natural rubber. This certification ensures the rubber is sourced from a forest that’s responsibly managed to prevent deforestation. Recycled materials: 40% of this sneaker’s sole is recycled rubber. It also has an OrthoLite® Hybrid insole made with recycled foam and rubber from previous production processes. ::Tab:: Fits true to size. Take your normal US size Only available in full sizes. Go down to the nearest whole size if you wear a half size. Width D - Standard Width can be adjusted by tightening/loosening the laces. Unsure of your size? Reach out to our team for a recommendation .', 265.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0646/1285/files/Capri-V3-charcoal-1.jpg?v=1762198392', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-04-16