(28, '7383900881065', 7, 'https://www.koio.co/products/koio-eco-protect', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Koio', 'Koio Eco Protect', 'You won’t have to worry about rain or snow when your shoes are protected with our Eco Protect spray. After cleaning your Koios with our Eco-Cleaner, simply spray it on to create an invisible water-resistant barrier. Formulated without propellants and solvents Designed to be used only after cleaning your Koios May darken some materials, so we recommend testing it on a small section before spraying your entire shoe Not suitable for use on patent-leather', 25.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0646/1285/products/Koio_Cleaning-Set_Eco-Protector_d97fbefe-f141-4e7d-a824-1af56117103e.png?v=1762198329', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-03-24 16:31:56', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Synthétique', 'Caoutchouc', 'Slip-on', 'inconnu', 'Spray protecteur pour chaussures', 1, 89.2105, 2, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre\",\n   \"age_cible\": {\n      \"min\": 25,\n      \"max\": 45\n   },\n   \"style_vie\": {\n      \"ville\": true,\n      \"activite_physique\": true,\n      \"voyages\": true,\n      \"soins_personnels\": true\n   },\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"conscientieux\": true,\n      \"écologique\": true,\n      \"influencé par les tendances\": true,\n      \"attaché à la qualité\": true,\n      \"préoccupé par la durabilité\": true\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": true,\n      \"sortie avec des amis\": true,\n      \"date ou soirée\": true,\n      \"loisirs ou sports\": true,\n      \"voyage ou déplacement\": true\n   }\n}', -0.334058, -0.232347, 89.1035),
(29, '7318294134953', 7, 'https://www.koio.co/products/capri-mocha-mens', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Koio', 'Capri Leather Sneaker in Mocha', 'The Capri in Mocha is a sophisticated sneaker handcrafted in Italy from luxurious brown full-grain leather, set on a matching tonal rubber sole. Equipped with an Ortholite tech-foam insole, it effortlessly blends luxury and comfort. Style casually with mid-wash jeans and a navy crewneck sweater, or elevate tailored ensembles with beige trousers and a light blazer. Handmade in Tuscany, Italy Constructed from vegetable-tanned Italian calf leather Brushed with a blend of waxes and oils that impart a velvety sheen Lined with Italian calf leather Set on a natural (50%), recycled (40%) and conventional (10%) rubber sole Tightly stitched for water resistance Threaded with waxed cotton laces Fitted with a removable OrthoLite® Hybrid™ insole Finished with hand-painted edges ::Tab:: LWG-certified leather: This sneaker is lined with leather that’s certified by the Leather Working Group (LWG), meaning it’s responsibly tanned in a facility that safely and carefully manages emissions, energy and water consumption, and waste. FSC®-certified natural rubber: 50% of this sneaker’s sole is Forest Stewardship Council®-certified (FSC®) natural rubber. This certification ensures the rubber is sourced from a forest that’s responsibly managed to prevent deforestation. Recycled materials: 40% of this sneaker’s sole is recycled rubber. It also has an OrthoLite® Hybrid insole made with recycled foam and rubber from previous production processes. ::Tab:: Fits true to size. Take your normal US size Only available in full sizes. Go down to the nearest whole size if you wear a half size. Width D - Standard Width can be adjusted by tightening/loosening the laces. Unsure of your size? Reach out to our team for a recommendation .', 265.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0646/1285/files/Capri-V2-mocha-1_4fb994e7-f114-4894-ae76-6875d2