(66, '7570361974832', 5, 'https://www.greats.com/products/the-kingston-blanco-grey-mens', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Greats', 'The Kingston - Blanco Grey', 'Introducing The Kingston, where old-school style meets the future of sneaker tech. Handcrafted in Portugal with rich premium goat leather that hugs and contours to your foot, its natural strength, flexibility, and lighter weight make these shoes the next best thing to being barefoot - unparalleled comfort right out of the box. Don\'t settle for less and see for yourself why these sneakers are ahead of the game.', 199.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0238/2821/files/KINL01SG-M1V-01.jpg?v=1757015271', '2026-03-24 16:32:33', '2026-03-24 16:32:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Gomme', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Sneaker en cuir avec confort et style', 1, 80.0526, 1, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Léo Dupont\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-35\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain actif\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"independant\",\n      \"confiant\",\n      \"dynamique\",\n      \"éclectique\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"sortie avec des amis\",\n      \"rendez-vous galant\",\n      \"week-end en ville\",\n      \"événement sportif\"\n   ]\n}', 0.515126, 0.400522, 80.0452),
(67, '7570147704880', 5, 'https://www.greats.com/products/the-kingston-nero-mens', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Greats', 'The Kingston - Nero', 'Feel the earth beneath your feet. Introducing The Kingston, where old-school style meets the future of sneaker tech. Handcrafted in Portugal with a full-grain leather alternative and out-of-the-box level comfort, make these shoes the definition of \"do good and feel good.\" Don\'t settle for less and see for yourself why these sneakers are ahead of the game.', 199.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0238/2821/files/KINL01SG-CUQ-01.jpg?v=1757015319', '2026-03-24 16:32:33', '2026-03-24 16:32:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Gomme', 'Slip-on', 'homme', 'Sneaker en cuir avec confort et style', 1, 80.0526, 3, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": {\n      \"activite\": \"urbain\",\n      \"loisirs\": [\"musique\", \"cinéma\", \"voyages\"],\n      \"mode_de_vie\": \"urbain dynamique\"\n   },\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"confiance\": \"élevée\",\n      \"ouverture\": \"ouvert\",\n      \"ambition\": \"forte\"\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"type\": \"formel\",\n      \"occasion\": \"soirée, événement, sortie avec des amis\"\n   }\n}', -0.296226, 0.575709, 80.0452),
(68, '7547837710384', 5, 'https://www.greats.com/products/the-corsa-driver-nero-mens', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Greats', 'The Corsa Driver - Nero', 'Introducing the Corsa Driver, a year-round classic that feels like a slipper and looks like a million bucks. Inspired by the original \'driving\' shoe - think Monza in the 1960s- the Corsa blends the comfort of a moccasin with the traction and durability to withstand daily wear. This hand-sewn style made of buttery-soft suede and full-grained leather has everything to become a wardrobe staple.', 189.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'out_of_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0238/2821/files/CORD01SG-CUQ-01.jpg?v=1757015075', '2026-03-24 16:32:33', '2026-03-24 16:32:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Toile', 'Gomme', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Sneaker en toile avec style et confort', 1, 80.5789, 1, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Léo\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain actif\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"motivé\": true,\n      \"ambitieux\": true,\n      \"independant\": true,\n      \"passionné\": true,\n      \"pragmatique\": true\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": \"tous les jours\"\n}', 0.303358, 0.110112, 80.5734),
(69, '7547842068528', 5, 'https://www.greats.com/products/the-corsa-driver-navy-mens', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Greats', 'The Corsa Driver - Navy', 'Introducing the Corsa Driver, a year-round classic that feels like a slipper and looks like a million bucks. Inspired by the original \'driving\' shoe - think Monza in the 1960s- the Corsa blends the comfort of a moccasin with the traction and durability to withstand daily wear. This hand-sewn style made of buttery-soft suede and full-grained leather has everything to become a wardrobe staple.', 189.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'out_of_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0238/2821/files/CORD01SG-9UU-01.jpg?v=1757015009', '2026-03-24 16:32:33', '2026-03-24 16:32:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Toile', 'Gomme', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Sneaker en toile avec style et confort', 1, 80.5789, 1, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-35\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain actif\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": 8,\n      \"independent\": 9,\n      \"passionné\": 7,\n      \"confiant\": 8,\n      \"pratique\": 6\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": 4,\n      \"sortie avec les amis\": 6,\n      \"sortie en couple\": 3,\n      \"sport\": 5,\n      \"loisirs\": 2\n   }\n}', 0.303358, 0.110112, 80.5734),
(70, '7567874719792', 5, 'https://www.greats.com/products/the-royale-2-0-slip-on-chocolate-mens', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Greats', 'The Royale 2.0 Slip On - Chocolate', 'A new spin on the shoe that started it all. The effortless cool look of the Royale 2.0, in an effortless slip-on fit. Already impossibly comfortable right out of the box, we replaced the shoelaces with a flexible elasticated panel to help you get out the door (or through airport security) faster. Our buttery smooth full grained leather and suede upper gives it a sleek new look that will carry you from weekend to workweek.', 199.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0238/2821/files/ROYS01SG-14Q-01.jpg?v=1757018077', '2026-03-24 16:32:33', '2026-03-24 16:32:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Gomme', 'Slip-on', 'homme', 'Sneaker en cuir avec confort et style', 1, 80.0526, 3, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Léo Dupont\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"confident\": 8,\n      \"independant\": 7,\n      \"éclectique\": 9,\n      \"prévisible\": 4,\n      \"conformiste\": 2\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"jour_nordique\": 6,\n      \"sortie_nuit\": 8,\n      \"week-end\": 9,\n      \"réunion_amis\": 7,\n      \"rendez-vous_pro\": 3\n   }\n}', -0.296226, 0.575709, 80.0452),
(71, '7566538244144', 5, 'https://www.greats.com/products/the-royale-2-0-slip-on-nero-mens', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Greats', 'The Royale 2.0 Slip On - Nero', 'A new spin on the shoe that started it all. The effortless cool look of the Royale 2.0, in an effortless slip-on fit. Already impossibly comfortable right out of the box, we replaced the shoelaces with a flexible elasticated panel to help you get out the door (or through airport security) faster. Our buttery smooth full grained leather and suede upper gives it a sleek new look that will carry you from weekend to workweek.', 199.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0238/2821/files/ROYS01SG-CUQ-01.jpg?v=1757018162', '2026-03-24 16:32:33', '2026-03-24 16:32:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Gomme', 'Slip-on', 'homme', 'Sneaker en cuir avec confort et style', 1, 80.0526, 3, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Léo Dupont\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-35\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"confident\": true,\n      \"independant\": true,\n      \"appreciate la qualité\": true,\n      \"sensibilisé à la mode\": true\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"jour de semaine\": \"sortie avec les amis\",\n      \"weekend\": \"sortie en ville ou en soirée\"\n   }\n}', -0.296226, 0.575709, 80.0452),
(72, '7555653140528', 5, 'https://www.greats.com/products/the-royale-2-0-light-grey-womens', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Greats', 'The Royale 2.0 - Light Grey', 'Since the launch of our iconic sneaker, the Royale has been the epitome of effortless cool. But even icons have to change to stay rooted in the present—which is why we\'ve created the Royale 2.0. A n evolved fit that feels impossibly comfortable right out of the box; gold foil branding details; the return of our signature tack stitch; and plenty more upgrades you\'ll just have to discover for yourself. Welcome to the 2.0 side of life.', 199.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'out_of_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0238/2821/files/RYLL02SG-EJM-01.jpg?v=1757108630', '2026-03-24 16:32:33', '2026-03-24 16:32:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Toile', 'Gomme', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Sneaker évoluée avec confort et style', 1, 80.0526, 1, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre Dupont\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain actif\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"confiant\",\n      \"independent\",\n      \"décontracté\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": \"sortie avec des amis, rendez-vous galant\"\n}', 0.303358, 0.110112, 80.0452),
(73, '7495699562544', 5, 'https://www.greats.com/products/the-regent-2-0-blanco-womens', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Greats', 'The Regent 2.0 - Blanco', 'More than meets the eye. This minimal, versatile silhouette is everything we want in our new essential sneaker—but did you know it\'s actually made with a corn-based leather alternative? This sustainable style in white sneakers for women is handcrafted from an innovative vegan material to create the refined look you love, while supporting the environment.', 189.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0238/2821/files/RGNT02SG-84D-01.jpg?v=1757031702', '2026-03-24 16:32:33', '2026-03-24 16:32:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Synthétique', 'Gomme', 'Lacets', 'femme', 'Sneaker en synthétique avec style et confort', 1, 80.5789, 1, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": {\n      \"activite\": \"urbain\",\n      \"loisirs\": [\"musique\", \"cinéma\", \"voyages\"],\n      \"mode_de_vie\": \"urbain dynamique\"\n   },\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"confiance\": \"élevé\",\n      \"ouverture\": \"ouvert\",\n      \"ambition\": \"forte\",\n      \"sensibilité\": \"moyen\"\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"type\": \"formel\",\n      \"occasion\": \"soirée, événement, sortie\"\n   }\n}', 0.136972, 0.0659138, 80.5734),
(74, '7495698022448', 5, 'https://www.greats.com/products/the-regent-2-0-blanco-mens', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Greats', 'The Regent 2.0 - Blanco', 'More than meets the eye. This minimal, versatile silhouette is everything we want in our new essential white sneaker for men — but did you know it\'s actually made with a corn-based leather alternative? This sustainable style is handcrafted in an innovative vegan material to create the refined look you love, while supporting the environment.', 94.97, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0238/2821/files/RGNT01SG-84D-01.jpg?v=1757015645', '2026-03-24 16:32:33', '2026-03-24 16:32:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Synthétique', 'Gomme', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Sneaker en synthétique avec style et confort', 1, 85.5279, 1, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain actif\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"ambitieux\",\n      \"independent\",\n      \"dynamique\",\n      \"appreciate la qualité\",\n      \"préoccupé par l\'élégance\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"rendez-vous professionnels\",\n      \"sorties nocturnes\",\n      \"voyages d\'affaires\",\n      \"événements sociaux\",\n      \"journées de travail\"\n   ]\n}', 0.136972, 0.0659138, 85.2718),
(75, '7495692615728', 5, 'https://www.greats.com/products/the-royale-knit-2-0-white-grey-womens', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Greats', 'The Royale Knit 2.0 - White Grey', 'Meet the new and improved version of our classic Royale Knit style - crafted with vegan materials and recycled plastic. This women\'s white sneaker is lightweight and comfortable, and the featherweight knit upper retains the shoe’s classic silhouette while minimizing bulk. Best of all, the durable, flexible knit cleans as easily as it wears. Beat it up, wear it in, then simply rinse it out with some soap and water. Just like that, your new favorite adventure shoe is back on track.', 179.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0238/2821/files/RYLK02SG-WG0-01.jpg?v=1757108703', '2026-03-24 16:32:33', '2026-03-24 16:32:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Synthétique', 'Gomme', 'Lacets', 'femme', 'Sneaker en synthétique avec style et confort', 1, 81.1053, 1, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-35\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"independent\",\n      \"ambitieux\",\n      \"dynamique\",\n      \"éclectique\",\n      \"conscient de l\'élégance\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"sorties nocturnes\",\n      \"rendez-vous\",\n      \"événements sociaux\",\n      \"voyages\",\n      \"journées de travail\"\n   ]\n}', 0.136972, 0.0659138, 81.0924),
(76, '7495675543600', 5, 'https://www.greats.com/products/the-royale-knit-2-0-white-navy-mens', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Greats', 'The Royale Knit 2.0 - White Navy', 'Meet the new and improved version of our classic Royale Knit style - crafted with vegan materials and recycled plastic. It\'s lightweight, comfortable, and the featherweight knit upper retains the shoe’s classic silhouette while minimizing bulk. Best of all, the durable, flexible knit cleans as easily as it wears. Beat it up, wear it in, then simply rinse it out with some soap and water. Just like that, your new favorite adventure shoe from our white sneakers collection is back on track.', 179.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0238/2821/files/GREATS-Mens-RoyaleKnit2.0-WhiteNavy-01_Web_6e9595c5-f8e2-4360-a157-68e9d300c9f7.jpg?v=1757531081', '2026-03-24 16:32:33', '2026-03-24 16:32:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Synthétique', 'Gomme', 'Lacets', 'femme', 'Sneaker en synthétique avec style et confort', 1, 81.1053, 1, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre Dupont\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain actif\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"ambitieux\",\n      \"independent\",\n      \"décontracté\",\n      \"éclectique\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"rendez-vous professionnel\",\n      \"sortie avec des amis\",\n      \"week-end en ville\",\n      \"événement sportif\"\n   ]\n}', 0.136972, 0.0659138, 81.0924);
