(105, '7598770913349', 3, 'https://taftclothing.com/products/the-luke-driver-moc-in-white', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'TAFT Clothing', 'The Luke in White', 'Handmade in a small family run factory,The Luke Driver Moc is what “Italian-made” feels like before you even take a step. Crafted using italian sourced calfskin, it features a tight, refined grain with a soft, natural texture that catches light quietly. In crisp white, there’s nowhere for shortcuts to hide the finishing has to be flawless, so it is. Handmade in Italy means clean seams, tidy stitchwork, and a silhouette that looks unmistakably premium in real life, not just in a photo. Underfoot, Strobel construction keeps it lightweight and flexible. The upper is stitched to a pliable base, so it moves with you from day one, less stiffness, more natural bend, and comfort that doesn’t require a “break-in period.” And because it’s Taft, the restraint is never plain. Catch a quiet glimpses of our Eden Blank hand-woven jacquard , a textural undercurrent that adds depth without interrupting the clean, modern line. It’s the kind of detail that feels discovered like a signature on the inside of a cuff meant for the person wearing it, and for the people sharp enough to notice. Finished with a driver outsole built for easy grip and smooth movement, the Luke is polished, effortless, and unmistakably Italian.', 299.99, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0468/9441/files/LUKE-WHT_WEB1_64c6d9f6-6c91-422d-ac40-aa93bcd1543d.jpg?v=1762447472', '2026-03-24 16:33:22', '2026-03-24 16:33:22', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Calfskin', 'Rubber', 'Slip-on', 'homme', 'Chaussure handmade en calfskin italien', 1, 74.7374, 0, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre Dupont\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"confiant\",\n      \"independent\",\n      \"soigne\",\n      \"appreciate la qualité\",\n      \"attaché à la mode\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"sorties nocturnes\",\n      \"réunions d\'affaires\",\n      \"voyages\",\n      \"dates\",\n      \"événements sociaux\"\n   ]\n}', -0.533505, -0.056718, 74.7631),
