(155, '6734750482501', 3, 'https://taftclothing.com/products/the-fitz-loafer-in-brown-check', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'TAFT Clothing', 'The Fitz Loafer in Brown Check (Last Chance, Final Sale)', 'The Fitz Loafer in Brown Check from TAFT features an exquisite print, handcrafted by artisans in Spain. This stylish loafer combines intricate detailing with superior craftsmanship for a distinctive look. • UPPER: Canvas with leather accents • OUTSOLE: Double leather sole with rubber inserts • Standard D Width • Blake Construction (resoleable) • Handmade by artisans in Spain Our boots and shoes that are leather soled can stain and bleed. We do not recommend wearing in wet conditions. Staining may bleed and could stain carpets, rugs, and upholstery materials.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0468/9441/products/LF-FITZ-BRNCHK_TAFT1.jpg?v=1762442410', '2026-03-24 16:33:22', '2026-03-24 16:33:22', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Toile', 'Caoutchouc', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Loafer en toile marron', 1, 77.9474, 2, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Emily Windsor\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"Raffinée et élégante\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": 0.8,\n      \"conformiste\": 0.6,\n      \"influencé par les tendances\": 0.9,\n      \"attaché à la qualité\": 0.8,\n      \"préoccupé par l\'image\": 0.7\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": 0.4,\n      \"sortie le soir\": 0.6,\n      \"réunion de famille\": 0.3,\n      \"événement social\": 0.5\n   }\n}', 0.293006, -0.522899, 77.9539),
(156, '7010752659525', 3, 'https://taftclothing.com/products/the-jude-boot-in-black-velour', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'TAFT Clothing', 'The Jude Boot in Black Velour', 'The Jude boot in Black Velour from TAFT boasts tailored lush velvet uppers, adding a touch of luxury and class to its design. With a slip-on closure and round-toe style, these men\'s boots effortlessly combine convenience and timeless class.', 349.99, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0468/9441/files/BT-JUDE-BLACKVELOUR_TAFT1.jpg?v=1762447301', '2026-03-24 16:33:22', '2026-03-24 16:33:22', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Velours', 'Caoutchouc', 'Slip-on', 'homme', 'Botte en velours noir', 1, 72.1058, 2, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Léa Dupont\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-35\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain-chic\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"indépendante\",\n      \"créative\",\n      \"éclectique\",\n      \"appreciative de la qualité\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"sorties nocturnes\",\n      \"rendez-vous amicaux\",\n      \"week-ends en ville\",\n      \"événements de mode\"\n   ]\n}', -0.290085, -0.233611, 72.1679),
