(223, '8224484524218', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/hudson-loafer-nubuck-men-s', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Hudson Loafer - Nubuck - Men´s', 'Classic design meets modern ease. The Hudson Loafer in velvety nubuck leather delivers superior comfort wrapped in timeless style. A lightweight, resilient EVA sole provides all-day support, and multi-layer construction enhances flexibility and cushioning with every step. The sleek upper, precise stitching, and subtle detailing frame the soft nubuck for a refined, contemporary look. Effortlessly blending sophistication with casual versatility, the Hudson Loafer is a wardrobe essential for those who value enduring comfort and understated luxury in equal measure. This product is made from supple and sultry nubuck leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 219.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_black_1_hudson_loafer_nubuck.jpg?v=1761064954', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Toile', 'Plateforme', 'Scratch', 'homme', 'Loafer classique avec confort moderne', 1, 79, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre\",\n   \"age_cible\": 35,\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": 0.8,\n      \"independant\": 0.7,\n      \"conscientieux\": 0.9,\n      \"décontracté\": 0.6\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": 0.4,\n      \"sortie avec amis\": 0.3,\n      \"rendez-vous professionnel\": 0.2,\n      \"loisirs\": 0.1\n   }\n}', -0.180928, -0.362493, 78.9975),
(224, '8225599979706', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/renee-chelsea-boot-women-s', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Renée Chelsea Boot - Women´s', 'Elegance in every step. The Renée Chelsea Boots, handcrafted from supple full-grain leather, are a modern classic rooted in traditional design. Ribbed elastic panels sculpt a sleek, flattering silhouette, and a discreet pull tab makes slipping them on effortless. Pairing strength with sophistication, a durable lug sole carries you securely from day to night. Refined and versatile, the Renée looks fantastic with tailored pants, flowing skirts and denim. This product is made from Gold Rated full-grain calfskin leather sourced from an environmentally responsible Italian tannery. The highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold Rating recognizes the manufacturer\'s strong commitment to minimizing environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_dove_1_renee_chelsea_boots.jpg?v=1760211287', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Gomme', 'Lacets', 'femme', 'Botte chelsea élégante', 1, 77.9474, 1, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Luna\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"28-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain chic\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"confiance\": 8,\n      \"independante\": 9,\n      \"élégante\": 9,\n      \"pratique\": 7,\n      \"éclectique\": 8\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"jour\": {\n         \"travail\": 7,\n         \"sortie avec amis\": 8,\n         \"rendez-vous galant\": 6\n      },\n      \"soir\": {\n         \"sortie avec amis\": 9,\n         \"dîner en ville\": 8,\n         \"événement social\": 7\n      }\n   }\n}', 0.515126, 0.400522, 77.9539),
(225, '8225828274362', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/renee-chelsea-boot-suede-women-s', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Renée Chelsea Boot - Suede - Women´s', 'An effortlessly elegant Chelsea Boot. Slip into a silhouette that feels both timeless and daringly fresh. The Renée Chelsea Boots, handcrafted from luxurious water-repellent suede, is sumptuously soft yet resilient enough for daily wear. The moment you pull them on, the ribbed elastic panels hug your ankle, and the lightweight, chunky sole moves effortlessly with you. From bustling city streets to weekend getaways, each step feels elevated and elegant. Pair them with suede skirts, raw denim and wool pants for lovely looks. This product is made from Gold Rated soft suede sourced from an environmentally responsible Italian tannery. The highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold Rating recognizes the manufacturer\'s strong commitment to minimizing environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_chocolate_1_renee_chelsea_boots_suede.jpg?v=1760548593', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Toile', 'Gomme', 'Lacets', 'femme', 'Botte chelsea élégante et résistante', 1, 77.9474, 1, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Sophie\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain-chic\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"confiance\": 8,\n      \"independante\": 9,\n      \"éclectique\": 7,\n      \"consciente de l\'environnement\": 6\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"jour\": {\n         \"travail\": 8,\n         \"sortie avec des amis\": 9,\n         \"rendez-vous galant\": 7\n      },\n      \"soir\": {\n         \"sortie au restaurant\": 9,\n         \"concert ou spectacle\": 8,\n         \"dîner en ville\": 7\n      }\n   }\n}', 0.303358, 0.110112, 77.9539),
