(230, '8186394607802', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/mercer-boot-men-s-pull-up-leather', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Mercer Boots - Pull Up Leather - Men’s', 'A distinctly bold boot. Built from robust pull-up leather that develops a rich patina over time, the Mercer Boots bring a bold, versatile edge to your wardrobe. Their durable, grippy sole keeps you steady, while thoughtful touches like reinforced eyelets and clean lines elevate the look. Shaped on our Denver last, the fit allows toes to move naturally and minimizes pressure points. Inside, full Vachetta leather lining and a dual-density memory foam insert work together to deliver day-long comfort without sacrificing style or substance. This product is made from robust pull-up leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 269.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_blackmatte_1_mercer_derbies_pull_up.jpg?v=1755823754', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Gomme', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Botte robuste et élégante', 1, 76.3684, 1, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Ethan Thompson\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"confiant\",\n      \"independant\",\n      \"appreciate la qualité\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"rendez-vous professionnels\",\n      \"sorties nocturnes\",\n      \"week-ends en ville\"\n   ]\n}', 0.515126, 0.400522, 76.3826),
