(234, '8154554073274', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/julia-loafers-women-s-full-grain-leather', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Julia Loafers - Full-Grain Leather - Women\'s', 'A fresh spin on a classic. If you value timeless style over fleeting trends, you’ll love the Julia Loafers in supple full-grain leather. With a fresh, dynamic sensibility, the Julia reimagines the classic silhouette of a traditional tassel loafer while honoring tradition. Fine detailing, like the handmade tassel and lacing, shine through from the toe to the heel. Supported by a lightweight, flexible TPU sole, you can depend on excellent traction without sacrificing elegance. The Julia Loafers adapt easily to different looks, giving you endless styling possibilities. This product is made from Gold Rated full-grain calfskin leather sourced from an environmentally responsible Italian tannery. The highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold Rating recognizes the manufacturer\'s strong commitment to minimizing environmental impact.', 219.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_black_1_julia_loafers.jpg?v=1762322079', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Plateforme', 'Scratch', 'femme', 'Loafer élégant et sophistiqué', 1, 79, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Sophie\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"28-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": 0.8,\n      \"independent\": 0.7,\n      \"soigneux\": 0.9,\n      \"éclectique\": 0.6\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": 0.4,\n      \"sortie nocturne\": 0.3,\n      \"réunion sociale\": 0.2,\n      \"loisirs\": 0.1\n   }\n}', -0.12992, -0.254733, 78.9975),
