(236, '8154168262842', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/clement-derby-men-s-pull-up-leather', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Clement Derby - Men’s  Pull Up Leather', 'Heritage meets bold modernity. The Clement Derby in robust pull-up leather brings bold character to a classic profile. With a supportive, slip-resistant sole and double welt construction, the rugged Clement is rooted in tradition yet styled for today. Handcrafted with durable materials that invite repeat wear, this derby is the perfect companion for jeans, cargos, or any utility-inspired look. Engineered for tougher terrain, the lightweight EVA sole ensures all-day comfort, traction and support. This product is made from robust pull-up leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_blackmatte_1_clement_derbies_pull_up.jpg?v=1755657617', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Gomme', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Derby robuste et élégant', 1, 77.9474, 1, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre\",\n   \"age_cible\": 35,\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": true,\n      \"confiant\": true,\n      \"décontracté\": true,\n      \"conscient de l\'élégance\": true\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"jour de travail\": true,\n      \"sorties nocturnes\": true,\n      \"rendez-vous amoureux\": true,\n      \"week-end en ville\": true\n   }\n}', 0.515126, 0.400522, 77.9539),
