(241, '8133209653434', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/maxwell-trainer-leather-suede-mens', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Maxwell Trainer - Leather & Suede - Men\'s', 'Elevates every fit. Step up your sneaker game with the Maxwell Trainer in luxurious full-grain leather and water-repellent suede. The bold contrast of textures creates a striking silhouette that’s elegant and effortlessly cool. Every detail is a nod to modern sophistication, handcrafted for unbeatable comfort and support, and grounded by a natural rubber sole for timeless appeal. Whether you\'re heading out on the town or keeping it casual, this trainer will elevate every fit and turn heads. This product is made with full-grain calfskin leather and water-repellent suede sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 179.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_whitebordeauxgum_1_beckett_icon_trainer.jpg?v=1756333409', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir et Suede', 'Caoutchouc', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Chaîne de montres élégante', 1, 81.1053, 2, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Ethan Thompson\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": true,\n      \"independent\": true,\n      \"appreciate la qualité\": true,\n      \"préoccupé par l\'élégance\": true,\n      \"valeur la durabilité\": true\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": true,\n      \"sortie nocturne\": true,\n      \"rendez-vous\": true,\n      \"week-end en ville\": true\n   }\n}', 0.102654, -0.403789, 81.0924),
