(243, '8131965812922', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/tessa-derby-water-repellent-suede', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Tessa Derby - Water-Repellent Suede - Women\'s', 'A statement derby . Add a bold, modern twist to your wardrobe with the Tessa Derbies in luxurious water-repellent suede. Taking inspiration from its roots as a shoe worn by trekkers in the French Alps, the modern Tessa is durable, practical and stylish. Handcrafted using traditional methods and lasting materials, this derby can be easily adapted to casual and more polished looks. Not only is the signature chunky sole secure and grippy, it brings height, depth and excitement to your outfits. This product is made from a soft suede sourced from a Gold Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 219.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_black_1_tessa_derbies_suede.jpg?v=1762321157', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Suede', 'Plateforme', 'Lacets', 'femme', 'Chaîne de montres élégante', 1, 79, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Luna Thompson\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"28-42\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain, sophistiqué, actif\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": 0.8,\n      \"independent\": 0.9,\n      \"éclectique\": 0.7,\n      \"conscientieux\": 0.6,\n      \"décontracté\": 0.4\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": 0.4,\n      \"sortie nocturne\": 0.3,\n      \"week-end\": 0.2,\n      \"loisirs\": 0.1\n   }\n}', -0.0895199, -0.410576, 78.9975),
