(245, '8108867780794', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/blaise-horsebit-boots', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Blaise Horsebit Boots - Full Grain Leather - Women\'s', 'Exquisitely modern boots. Fusing the charm of a classic horsebit loafer with the bold, modern style of a chunky zip-up boot, the Blaise Horsebit Boots are a fashion-forward statement piece. The harmonious combination results in boots that don’t only look stylish but feel great to wear. Handcrafted from luxurious full-grain leather and supported by a raised TPU sole, these one-of-a-kind boots present a sophisticated and polished look while offering durability and lasting beauty. Pair the Blaise Horsebit Boots with a variety of pieces, like dresses and jeans, for attention-grabbing ensembles. This product is made from Gold Rated full-grain calfskin leather sourced from an environmentally responsible Italian tannery. The highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold Rating recognizes the manufacturer\'s strong commitment to minimizing environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_black_1_blaise_horsebit_boot.jpg?v=1762318803', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Plateforme', 'Zip', 'femme', 'Chaîne de montres élégante', 1, 77.9474, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Sophie\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": 8,\n      \"independent\": 9,\n      \"consciente de l\'élégance\": 10,\n      \"appreciative de la qualité\": 9,\n      \"attachée à la mode\": 8\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": 6,\n      \"sorties nocturnes\": 8,\n      \"rendez-vous amicaux\": 7,\n      \"week-end en ville\": 9\n   }\n}', -0.112489, -0.203012, 77.9539),
(246, '8085337768122', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/jenna-zip-up-boots-women-s-water-repellent-suede', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Jenna Zip Up Boots - Women’s  Water-Repellent Suede', 'A statement piece. The Jenna Zip-Up Boots in textured water-repellent suede are unlike any boots you’ve ever worn. Seamlessly combining ruggedness and refinement, these boots add a luxurious edge to your looks. The bold YKK zipper running down the center of the boot, and the chunky rubber sole, create a distinct profile that’s perfect for when you want to make a statement. Pair the Jennas with different textures, colors and styles for an always effortlessly chic look. This product is made from Gold Rated soft suede sourced from an environmentally responsible Italian tannery. The highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold Rating recognizes the manufacturer\'s strong commitment to minimizing environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_black_1_jenna_zip_up_boots_suede.jpg?v=1762317754', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Suede', 'Caoutchouc', 'Zip', 'femme', 'Chaîne de montres élégante', 1, 77.9474, 2, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandra\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"confiance\": 8,\n      \"independante\": 9,\n      \"éclectique\": 7,\n      \"pratique\": 6,\n      \"consciente de l\'environnement\": 5\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"jour de travail\": 6,\n      \"sortie avec des amis\": 8,\n      \"week-end en ville\": 9,\n      \"événement de mode\": 4,\n      \"activités de plein air\": 3\n   }\n}', -0.105708, -0.451391, 77.9539),
(247, '8085333868730', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/jenna-zip-up-boots-women-s-full-grain-leather', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Jenna Zip Up Boots - Women’s  Full-Grain Leather', 'A bold, statement boot. Step out with confidence in a pair of bold Jenna Zip-Up Boots in supple full-grain leather. The heavy duty YKK zipper sliding down the front, and the chunky sole, create a statement-making profile, and bolster the overall durability. Combining the rebellious spirit of a motorcycle boot with the sleek elegance of an ankle bootie, the Jennas pair well with casual denim, edgier dresses and knockout outfits for looks that will grab a lot of attention. This product is made from Gold Rated full-grain calfskin leather sourced from an environmentally responsible Italian tannery. The highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold Rating recognizes the manufacturer\'s strong commitment to minimizing environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_black_1_jenna_zip_up_boots.jpg?v=1762317752', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Caoutchouc', 'Zip', 'femme', 'Chaîne de montres élégante', 1, 77.9474, 2, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Sophie\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": {\n      \"activite\": \"urbaine\",\n      \"loisirs\": [\"shopping\", \"sorties avec des amis\"],\n      \"mode_de_vie\": \"urbain\"\n   },\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"estime_de_soi\": \"élevée\",\n      \"influence\": \"moyenne\",\n      \"conformisme\": \"faible\",\n      \"ouverture\": \"élevée\"\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"occasion\": \"tous les jours\",\n      \"type_evenement\": [\"sorties avec des amis\", \"rendez-vous\"],\n      \"lieu\": [\"ville\", \"centre-ville\"]\n   }\n}', 0.0379016, -0.321779, 77.9539),
(248, '8033898070202', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/gregory-buckle-boots-men-s-suede', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Gregory Buckle Boots - Men’s  Suede', 'A sophisticated yet understated boot. Gregory Buckle Boots in rich water-repellent suede fuse elegant design with a casual edge to offer you a unique profile. And the supportive, flexible, lightweight UrbanLite rubber sole adds to the boots’ comfort while enhancing the laid-back aesthetic. Modern and ready for adventure, Gregory Buckle Boots are the perfect complement to relaxed or dressier attire. Pair them with jeans, chinos, wool trousers and corduroy for looks that elevate the everyday. This product is made from luxurious suede sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 269.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_brown_1_gregory_buckle_boots_suede.jpg?v=1762316159', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Suede', 'Caoutchouc', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Chaîne de montres élégante', 1, 76.3684, 2, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre Dupont\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": 8,\n      \"independent\": 9,\n      \"soigneux\": 7,\n      \"éclectique\": 6,\n      \"conformiste\": 2\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": 8,\n      \"sortie nocturne\": 6,\n      \"week-end en ville\": 9,\n      \"réunion professionnelle\": 7\n   }\n}', 0.12913, -0.587174, 76.3826),
(249, '8020840579258', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/gregory-buckle-boots-men-s-full-grain-leather', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Gregory Buckle Boots - Men’s  Full-Grain Leather', 'A unique boot. The Gregory Buckle Boot in full-grain leather combines the attractive profile of a chukka boot with the suave accenting of a monkstrap shoe to create something truly unique. Perfect for elegant occasions, the minimal yet refined design seamlessly complements any outfit. Make the Gregory Buckle Boot a staple of your wardrobe and embrace luxury with every step. This product is made from full-grain calfskin leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 269.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_black_1_gregory_buckle_boots.jpg?v=1755804289', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Caoutchouc', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Chaîne de montres élégante', 1, 76.3684, 2, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre Dupont\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": 8,\n      \"confiant\": 7,\n      \"independent\": 9,\n      \"soigneux\": 8,\n      \"éclectique\": 6\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": 8,\n      \"sortie nocturne\": 7,\n      \"rendez-vous amical\": 6,\n      \"week-end en ville\": 9,\n      \"événementiel\": 5\n   }\n}', 0.460434, -0.413131, 76.3826);
