(250, '8008075149498', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/lewis-tassel-loafers-men-s', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Lewis Tassel Loafers - Men’s', 'A truly iconic loafer. With a nod to the preppy aesthetic made popular on university campuses, the Lewis Tassel Loafers in supple full-grain leather are perfect for your casual and semi-formal looks. The smooth upper is adorned by a statement making tassel that sets off the tubular moccasin construction. And hand stitching ensures the structure will stay intact even as the leather starts to conform to the shape of your feet. This super comfortable iconic style is highly adaptable, and pairs particularly well with chinos, cotton twill, wool and corduroy trousers. This product is made from full-grain calfskin leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_black_1_lewis_loafers.jpg?v=1762315130', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Caoutchouc', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Chaîne de montres élégante', 1, 77.9474, 2, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre Dupont\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-50\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"Professionnel\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"Ambitieux\",\n      \"Sérieux\",\n      \"Attentif aux détails\",\n      \"Apprécie la qualité\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"Réunions de travail\",\n      \"Réceptions de gala\",\n      \"Sorties avec des clients\",\n      \"Journées de travail en bureau\"\n   ]\n}', 0.460434, -0.413131, 77.9539),
(251, '8008435826874', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/perry-belgian-loafer-men-s', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Perry Belgian Loafer - Full Grain Leather - Men\'s', 'The essential loafer. With a tapered waist and contoured profile, the refined Perry Belgian Loafers in smooth full-grain leather give you an elegant look that’s perfect for dressier occasions. Made special by the sophisticated tassel ornamentation, these loafers also look gorgeous with more relaxed attire—just don’t go too casual. Classic and traditional, but with contemporary flare, the Perry’s are an essential part of your wardrobe. This product is made from full-grain calfskin leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_black_1_perry_belgian_loafers.jpg?v=1762315169', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Caoutchouc', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Chaîne de montres élégante', 1, 77.9474, 2, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre Dupont\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-50\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": 8,\n      \"confiant\": 7,\n      \"discernant\": 9,\n      \"independent\": 6,\n      \"prévisiblement créatif\": 5\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": 8,\n      \"sortie nocturne\": 7,\n      \"réunion professionnelle\": 9,\n      \"rendez-vous amical\": 6,\n      \"week-end en ville\": 8\n   }\n}', 0.460434, -0.413131, 77.9539),
(252, '8008550023354', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/perry-belgian-loafer-men-s-water-repellent-suede', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Perry Belgian Loafer - Men’s Water-Repellent Suede', 'Elegant, laid-back loafers. The Perry Belgian Loafer in textured water-repellent suede combines elegance and laid-back, carefree style. The flattering shape and contours look at once classic and modern for a refined appearance that pairs well with smart-casual and relaxed outfits. And the ornamental tassel adds a touch of sophistication that elevates your everyday looks. This product is made from naturally water-repellent suede sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_brown_1_perry_belgian_loafers_suede.jpg?v=1762315169', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Suede', 'Caoutchouc', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Chaîne de montres élégante', 1, 77.9474, 2, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre Dupont\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": true,\n      \"independent\": true,\n      \"appreciate la qualité\": true,\n      \"soucieux de l\'environnement\": true\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": true,\n      \"sorties nocturnes\": true,\n      \"week-end en ville\": true,\n      \"réunions professionnelles\": true\n   }\n}', 0.12913, -0.587174, 77.9539),
(253, '7987559923898', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/emma-derby-womens', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Emma Derby - Full Grain Leather - Women\'s', 'Cool, Casual Derbies Ready for a style that’s at once familiar and a bit different? The Emma Derby is a comfortable and versatile choice that works beautifully with office attire, and transitions easily for your off-hours fun. The signature elements of a classic derby shoe, like the comfy open lacing system, are on full display and supported by a contemporary chunky lug sole. Wear them with boyfriend jeans or long skirts for effortlessly cool outfits that always look and feel fresh. This product is made from Gold Rated full-grain calfskin leather sourced from an environmentally responsible Italian tannery. The highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold Rating recognizes the manufacturer\'s strong commitment to minimizing environmental impact.', 219.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_black_1_emma_derbies.jpg?v=1762312825', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Caoutchouc', 'Lacets', 'femme', 'Chaîne de montres élégante', 1, 79, 2, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Sophie\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"28-42\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"confiante\",\n      \"independante\",\n      \"appreciative de la qualité\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"rendez-vous\",\n      \"sortie professionnelle\",\n      \"soirée\"\n   ]\n}', 0.460434, -0.413131, 78.9975),
(254, '7987646136506', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/emma-derby-water-repellent-suede', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Emma Derby - Water Repellent Suede', 'Timeless and modern derbies . Inspired by the combination of timeless elegance and modern day elements, the Emma Derby in fuzzy water-repellent suede sets you up for so many possibilities. The minimal lines and supportive chunky soles raise the classic derby profile and create a modern, trendy look. Wear these beauties with culotte pants, belted dresses or jeans for looks that carry you from day to night without missing a beat. This product is made from a soft suede sourced from a Gold Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 219.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_black_1_emma_derbies_suede.jpg?v=1762312826', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Suede', 'Caoutchouc', 'Lacets', 'femme', 'Chaîne de montres élégante', 1, 79, 2, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre Dubois\",\n   \"age_cible\": 35,\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": true,\n      \"independent\": true,\n      \"appreciate la qualité\": true,\n      \"conscient de l\'environnement\": false\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"jour de travail\": true,\n      \"sorties nocturnes\": true,\n      \"week-end en ville\": true,\n      \"événements spéciaux\": true\n   }\n}', 0.12913, -0.587174, 78.9975),
(255, '7938253684922', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/bianca-chelsea-boots-womens', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Bianca Chelsea Boots - Full Grain Leather - Women\'s', 'A unique Chelsea boot . Inspired by cowboy boots and western styling, the Bianca Chelsea Boots kick things up a few notches. The semi square toe box, alluring Cuban heel and sculptural shape create a captivating silhouette that will attract the right kind of attention. With a contemporary look and feel, the Biancas love to have fun, and play well with your casual outfits and dressy ensembles. Go ahead, take them for a whirl. This product is made from Gold Rated full-grain calfskin leather sourced from an environmentally responsible Italian tannery. The highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold Rating recognizes the manufacturer\'s strong commitment to minimizing environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_black_1_bianca_chelsea_boots.jpg?v=1762312430', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Caoutchouc', 'Lacets', 'femme', 'Chaîne de montres élégante', 1, 77.9474, 2, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Sophie\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"28-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain-chic\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": 0.8,\n      \"independent\": 0.9,\n      \"élégant\": 0.7,\n      \"pratique\": 0.6\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": 0.4,\n      \"sortie du soir\": 0.3,\n      \"week-end\": 0.2,\n      \"réunion sociale\": 0.1\n   }\n}', 0.460434, -0.413131, 77.9539),
(256, '7657400238266', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/vincent-belgian-loafers-pebbled-leather', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Vincent Belgian Loafers - Pebbled Leather - Men\'s', 'Slip into elegance. With a stylized, elegant silhouette, the Vincent Belgian Loafer in alluring pebbled leather brings a heightened sense of sophistication to your wardrobe. The understated and subtle appearance adapts easily to different looks, from super casual to supremely formal. Comfortable from the moment you slip into them, the Vincents will become even more so as the leather conforms to the shape of your feet the more you wear them - and you might want to wear them all the time. This product is made from full-grain calfskin leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_black_1_vincent_belgian_loafers_pebbled.jpg?v=1762310233', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Caoutchouc', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Chaîne de montres élégante', 1, 77.9474, 2, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": true,\n      \"discernant\": true,\n      \"préoccupé par la qualité\": true,\n      \"attaché à la mode\": true,\n      \"prévisible\": true\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": true,\n      \"réunions professionnelles\": true,\n      \"sorties nocturnes\": true,\n      \"voyages d\'affaires\": true,\n      \"journées de week-end\": false\n   }\n}', 0.460434, -0.413131, 77.9539),
(257, '7657502867642', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/vincent-belgian-loafer-suede', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Vincent Belgian Loafer - Suede - Men\'s', 'Set the bar high. Showcase a sophisticated sense of style with the Vincent Belgian Loafers in luxe water-repellent suede. Form fitting, attractive and complementary to your body and wardrobe, these loafers set the bar high. Showcasing impeccable craftsmanship, the Vincents elevate your casual outfits and add depth to your suited looks while supporting you from day to night. This product is made from luxurious suede sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_black_1_vincent_belgian_loafers_suede.jpg?v=1762310252', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Suede', 'Caoutchouc', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Chaîne de montres élégante', 1, 77.9474, 2, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambition\": 8,\n      \"sensibilité\": 6,\n      \"independance\": 9,\n      \"conformisme\": 4\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": 7,\n      \"sortie nocturne\": 8,\n      \"réunion professionnelle\": 9,\n      \"rendez-vous amical\": 6\n   }\n}', 0.12913, -0.587174, 77.9539),
(258, '7585306312890', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/gemma-pump-suede-womens', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Gemma Pump - Suede - Women\'s', 'Sophisticated and elegant . The Gemma Pump in luxurious soft suede adds a sophisticated, chic and elegant accent to your outfits. The svelte silhouette elongates your legline and the heel gives you just the right amount of lift. Pair these stunning pumps with tailored suits, pleated skirts, and minimal dresses for a gorgeous look every time. This product is made from Gold Rated soft suede sourced from an environmentally responsible Italian tannery. The highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold Rating recognizes the manufacturer\'s strong commitment to minimizing environmental impact.', 229.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_black_1_gemma_pumps_suede.jpg?v=1762309574', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Suede', 'Caoutchouc', 'Lacets', 'femme', 'Chaîne de montres élégante', 1, 78.4737, 2, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Luna\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"28-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"confiance\": 8,\n      \"independance\": 9,\n      \"sensibilité\": 7,\n      \"éclectisme\": 8,\n      \"élégance\": 9\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"jour\": \"soirée\",\n      \"evenement\": \"rendez-vous\",\n      \"lieu\": \"ville\",\n      \"activité\": \"sortie\"\n   }\n}', 0.12913, -0.587174, 78.4876),
(259, '7585290551482', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/gemma-pump-womens', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Gemma Pump - Full Grain Leather - Women\'s', 'Elevate your style . The Gemma Pump in full-grain leather is an essential part of your wardrobe. With a pristine silhouette, they’re highly adaptable and elevate your style effortlessly. The heel is calibrated to give you a boost in height, and works in concert with the overall structure to provide all day balance and support. Pair them with your business outfits, sleek skirts, tailored pants or flared jeans and always step out with confidence. This product is made from Gold Rated full-grain calfskin leather sourced from an environmentally responsible Italian tannery. The highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold Rating recognizes the manufacturer\'s strong commitment to minimizing environmental impact.', 229.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_black_1_gemma_pumps.jpg?v=1762309572', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Caoutchouc', 'Lacets', 'femme', 'Chaîne de montres élégante', 1, 78.4737, 2, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Sophie\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"28-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": 0.8,\n      \"confiant\": 0.7,\n      \"independent\": 0.9,\n      \"soigne\": 0.95\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": 0.6,\n      \"sortie nocturne\": 0.4,\n      \"rendez-vous\": 0.8,\n      \"loisirs\": 0.5\n   }\n}', 0.460434, -0.413131, 78.4876),
(260, '7584679002298', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/mona-flat-suede-womens', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Mona Flat - Suede - Women\'s', 'Light on your feet . Incredibly convenient and oh-so-comfortable, the Mona Flats in luxe water-repellent suede fill a gap in our collection - and in your closet. With minimal lines and a soft silhouette, this always fashionable style is perfect for everyday wear, and looks great with dresses, jeans or capris. The velvety soft suede will retain its shape while aging gracefully and giving you years of enjoyment. And the supportive TPU sole will keep you safe, even on slippery surfaces. This product is made from Gold Rated soft suede sourced from an environmentally responsible Italian tannery. The highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold Rating recognizes the manufacturer\'s strong commitment to minimizing environmental impact .', 219.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_chocolate_1_mona_w_flats_suede.jpg?v=1762309571', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Suede', 'Caoutchouc', 'Lacets', 'femme', 'Chaîne de montres élégante', 1, 79, 2, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Léa Dupont\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"28-38\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbaine, sophistiquée, professionnelle\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"confiante\",\n      \"independante\",\n      \"soigneuse\",\n      \"appreciative de la qualité\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": \"rendez-vous, soirée, travail\"\n}', 0.12913, -0.587174, 78.9975),
(261, '7584650821818', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/mona-flat-womens', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Mona Flat - Full Grain Leather - Women\'s', 'Fit like a glove . With a timeless silhouette, the Mona Flats in full-grain leather are our version of the classic ballerina slipper. Convenient and attractive, the Mona Flats are handcrafted to fit like a glove and designed to pair easily with a variety of looks, like sleek office ensembles, flowy floral dresses, light washed jeans and tailored pants. Supported by a thin, lightweight and grippy TPU sole, you’ll enjoy lasting comfort and style for many years to come. This product is made from Gold Rated full-grain calfskin leather sourced from an environmentally responsible Italian tannery. The highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold Rating recognizes the manufacturer\'s strong commitment to minimizing environmental impact.', 219.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_black_1_mona_w_flats.jpg?v=1762309569', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'TPU', 'Slip-on', 'femme', 'Ballerina slipper en cuir', 1, 79, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Sophie\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"28-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"independante\": true,\n      \"professionnelle\": true,\n      \"appreciative de la qualité\": true,\n      \"attachée à la mode\": true,\n      \"préoccupée par l\'environnement\": false\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": true,\n      \"sortie avec des amis\": true,\n      \"rendez-vous romantique\": true,\n      \"shopping\": true,\n      \"autres\": false\n   }\n}', -0.344816, 0.0522174, 78.9975),
