(264, '7491459940538', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/amelia-chelsea-boots', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Amelia Chelsea Boots - Full Grain Leather - Women\'s', 'Playful boots. The Amelia Chelsea Boots in full-grain leather give you the impact of a combat boot and the style of a Chelsea. With signature elastic side gussets, a fun belted strap around the ankle-high shaft, and grippy platform TPU soles, these playful boots will have you strutting down the street with a confident flourish. Pair the Amelias with cuffed jeans, flared pants, skirts and flowing dresses for looks that express your personality and style. This product is made from Gold Rated full-grain calfskin leather sourced from an environmentally responsible Italian tannery. The highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold Rating recognizes the manufacturer\'s strong commitment to minimizing environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_black_1_amelia_chelsea.jpg?v=1762307425', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'TPU', 'Lacets', 'femme', 'Chausses en cuir', 1, 77.9474, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Emily Wilson\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"confiance\": 8,\n      \"independance\": 9,\n      \"sensibilité\": 7,\n      \"prévisibilité\": 6\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"jour\": {\n         \"travail\": 8,\n         \"sortie avec amis\": 6,\n         \"rendez-vous galant\": 4\n      },\n      \"soir\": {\n         \"sortie avec amis\": 8,\n         \"dîner en ville\": 9,\n         \"événement social\": 7\n      }\n   }\n}', 0.132242, -0.137218, 77.9539),
(265, '7491363635386', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/georgia-loafers-water-repellent-suede', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Georgia Loafers - Suede - Women\'s', 'Fresh and unique loafers. Georgia Loafers in nappy water-repellent suede are an elegant, fresh and unique update to the chunky loafer style. With contemporary styling and a statement-making sole, they pair beautifully with loose jeans, fitted pants, flowy skirts or long dresses. Show the world who you are and walk with confidence all day long. This product is made from Gold Rated soft suede sourced from an environmentally responsible Italian tannery. The highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold Rating recognizes the manufacturer\'s strong commitment to minimizing environmental impact.', 219.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_chocolate_1_georgia_loafers_suede.jpg?v=1762307421', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Suede', 'TPU', 'Slip-on', 'femme', 'Loafers en suede', 1, 79, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Sophie\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain chic\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": 0.8,\n      \"independant\": 0.7,\n      \"éclectique\": 0.9,\n      \"appreciate la qualité\": 0.8,\n      \"préoccupé par l\'environnement\": 0.5\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": 0.6,\n      \"sortie avec des amis\": 0.8,\n      \"rendez-vous romantique\": 0.4,\n      \"week-end en ville\": 0.7,\n      \"événements sociaux\": 0.5\n   }\n}', -0.46922, -0.12976, 78.9975),
(266, '7490512355514', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/georgia-loafers', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Georgia Loafers - Full Grain Leather - Women\'s', 'Always look cool. Chunky loafers, like our Georgia Loafers in supple full-grain leather, are a fashion mainstay that always looks cool. Inspired by the classic penny loafer, but designed to have an edgy, modern profile, this wardrobe essential gives you a funky alternative to more traditional styles. The lug sole adds a boost in height, but not too much. You’ll always make a statement no matter what you wear your Georgia Loafers with. This product is made from Gold Rated full-grain calfskin leather sourced from an environmentally responsible Italian tannery. The highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold Rating recognizes the manufacturer\'s strong commitment to minimizing environmental impact.', 219.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_black_1_georgia_loafers.jpg?v=1762307420', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'TPU', 'Slip-on', 'femme', 'Loafers en cuir', 1, 79, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Sophie\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"28-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"confiante\",\n      \"independante\",\n      \"appreciative de la qualité\",\n      \"préoccupée par l\'élégance\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"rendez-vous professionnel\",\n      \"sorties nocturnes\",\n      \"week-ends en ville\",\n      \"voyages d\'affaires\"\n   ]\n}', -0.344816, 0.0522174, 78.9975),
(267, '3964795224143', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/nolan-brogue-boots-pull-up', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Nolan Brogue Boots - Pull-Up - Men\'s', 'Boots designed for comfort. When you need a rugged yet stylish boot to pair with just about anything, the Nolan brogue boots have you covered. This edition of the Nolans is handmade with handsome pull-up leather, which is infused with hot oil emulsions and natural waxes during the tanning process for a rustic appearance. These classic and timeless boots will look and feel better the more you wear them, and they’ll develop a personalized patina over time. This product is made from robust pull-up leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 269.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/products/color_brown_1_nolan_brogue_boots_pull_up.jpg?v=1762198191', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Pull-Up', 'TPU', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Chausses en cuir', 1, 76.3684, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Ethan Thompson\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": true,\n      \"confiant\": true,\n      \"décontracté\": true,\n      \"conscient de l\'élégance\": true\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"jour de travail\": true,\n      \"sortie en ville\": true,\n      \"réunion professionnelle\": true,\n      \"événement social\": true\n   }\n}', -0.0429171, -0.241436, 76.3826),
(268, '7472625549498', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/williamson-boots', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Williamson Boots - Men\'s', 'Boots that stand out. The Williamson Boots in supple full-grain leather combine the security and solid build of workwear-inspired footwear with the refinement of a dressy boot. Carefully constructed to ensure your utmost comfort and safety, the Williamsons also showcase meticulous stitching details to accentuate the contours of the boot. The reinforced solid brass eyelets make lacing a breeze, and the two solid brass speed hooks can be used to secure a tighter fit, or as an attractive ornamentation. Pair the Williamson Boots with jeans, trousers or a casual suit and you’ll always have a standout look. This product is made from full-grain calfskin leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 269.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_tan_1_williamson_boots.jpg?v=1762307279', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'TPU', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Chausses en cuir', 1, 76.3684, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Ethan Thompson\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-50\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain, professionnel, actif\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"confiant\",\n      \"independent\",\n      \"appreciate la qualité\",\n      \"préoccupé par l\'élégance\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"travail\",\n      \"sorties nocturnes\",\n      \"week-end en ville\",\n      \"réunions professionnelles\"\n   ]\n}', 0.132242, -0.137218, 76.3826),
(269, '7472127934650', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/morgen-trainers-leather-suede-gum-sole-womens', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Morgen Trainers - Leather/Suede - Gum Sole - Women\'s', 'A signature piece. Inspired by the look of the classic German Army Trainer, our Morgen Trainers balance supple full-grain leather, textured water-repellent suede and the signature natural gum rubber sole. These durable, lightweight materials will carry and support you from day to night with dressy and casual outfits. Pair them with tailored attire for a crisp look, or loose vintage jeans and flowy skirts for something more carefree. Collect them in all the rich colorways and you’ll always have beautiful sneakers to complement just about anything in your wardrobe. This product is made from full-grain calfskin leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 179.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_blackwhitegum_1_morgen_w_trainers_leather_suede_b1fc92c0-5b0e-4750-aa9c-639d7b36f628.jpg?v=1759257414', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir/Suede', 'Caoutchouc', 'Slip-on', 'femme', 'Trainers en cuir et suede', 1, 81.1053, 2, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Luna\",\n   \"age_cible\": {\n      \"min\": 25,\n      \"max\": 40\n   },\n   \"style_vie\": {\n      \"urban\": 0.7,\n      \"bohème\": 0.3\n   },\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"confiante\": 0.8,\n      \"independante\": 0.9,\n      \"éclectique\": 0.7\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"journée\": 0.6,\n      \"soirée\": 0.4\n   }\n}', -0.301811, -0.226528, 81.0924),
(270, '7412673708218', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/maeve-chelsea-boots-suede', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Maeve Chelsea Boots - Suede - Women\'s', 'Warm and cozy. With a rich, deep texture and a modern profile, Maeve Chelsea Boots in alluring water-repellent suede elevate your modest looks with ease, and make a fashion statement with your more vibrant outfits. The earthy tones and attractive elastic side gussets exude a warm and cozy spirit that looks gorgeous with cuffed jeans, heavier fabrics and refined silhouettes. Extremely comfortable and balanced, wear these boots confidently all day and well into the night without worrying about pain or fatigue. This product is made from Gold Rated soft suede sourced from an environmentally responsible Italian tannery. The highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold Rating recognizes the manufacturer\'s strong commitment to minimizing environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_chocolate_1_maeve_boots_suede.jpg?v=1762304492', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Suede', 'TPU', 'Lacets', 'femme', 'Chausses en suede', 1, 77.9474, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Sophie\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"28-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": 8,\n      \"créatif\": 6,\n      \"independent\": 9,\n      \"sophistiqué\": 7\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"jour\": {\n         \"travail\": 8,\n         \"sortie avec amis\": 6,\n         \"rendez-vous galant\": 4\n      },\n      \"soir\": {\n         \"dîner en ville\": 9,\n         \"sortie culturelle\": 8,\n         \"événement social\": 7\n      }\n   }\n}', -0.0549763, -0.3118, 77.9539),
