(272, '7412687110330', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/savannah-booties', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Savannah Booties - Full Grain Leather - Women\'s', 'Elevated design and comfort. With a flawless, unadorned profile, a sophisticated pointed toe and a form-fitting shaft, the Savannah Booties display your confidence and individuality. In addition to making a statement, the Savannahs are supported by a slightly raised heel and a slender leather sole that will support you from morning to night.  Fully lined with breathable Vachetta leather and cushioned by a padded insole, you’ll always be well protected by these boots which are secured by a hidden, highly dependable YKK Vision Zipper. This product is made from Gold Rated full-grain calfskin leather sourced from an environmentally responsible Italian tannery. The highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold Rating recognizes the manufacturer\'s strong commitment to minimizing environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_black_1_savannah_boots.jpg?v=1762304492', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Cuir', 'Lacets', 'femme', 'Chausses en cuir', 1, 77.9474, 1, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Emily Wilson\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"28-42\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain-chic\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"confiante\",\n      \"independante\",\n      \"décontractée\",\n      \"appreciative de la qualité\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"sorties nocturnes\",\n      \"dîners en ville\",\n      \"rendez-vous amicaux\",\n      \"vacances de week-end\"\n   ]\n}', 0.414644, 0.0675711, 77.9539),
(273, '4327325106255', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/lopez-boots-pull-up', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Lopez Boots - Pull-Up - Men\'s', 'A boot for work and play Rooted in their WWI Service Boot heritage, the Lopez Boots have been refined to reflect the aesthetic of today’s gentlemen. Trademarks of their origins as a service boot still standout: a classic plain-toe, seven eyelets and an ankle-length shaft. Our version has been modernized with handsome waxed pull-up leather, clean lines and double layered soles. They look fantastic with denim, chinos, flannels, and even a casual suit. This product is made from robust pull-up leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 269.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/products/color_brown_1_lopez_boots_pullup.jpg?v=1762198271', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Pull-Up', 'TPU', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Chausses en cuir', 1, 76.3684, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Ethan Thompson\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"28-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain, professionnel, actif\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"confiant\",\n      \"independent\",\n      \"débrouillard\",\n      \"appreciate la qualité\",\n      \"valeur la durabilité\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"rendez-vous professionnels\",\n      \"sorties nocturnes\",\n      \"week-ends en ville\",\n      \"voyages d\'affaires\",\n      \"événements sociaux\"\n   ]\n}', -0.0429171, -0.241436, 76.3826),
(274, '4327301808207', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/preston-chelsea-boots-suede', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Preston Chelsea Boots - Suede - Men\'s', 'An effortless boot. The laceless design of the Prestons allows the full-grain leather to shine, and the high quality elastic side panels ensure they’ll slip on and off with ease. A comfortably snug fit is guaranteed. Whether you’re sporting your sharpest suit or your most comfortable pair of jeans, the Preston Chelsea Boots are the way to go. This product is made from luxurious suede sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 269.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/products/color_brown_1_preston_chelsea_boots_suede.jpg?v=1762198269', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Suede', 'TPU', 'Slip-on', 'homme', 'Chausses en suede', 1, 76.3684, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Ethan Thompson\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"Raffiné\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": 0.8,\n      \"confiant\": 0.7,\n      \"élégant\": 0.9,\n      \"prévisiblement traditionnel\": 0.6\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": 0.4,\n      \"sortie nocturne\": 0.3,\n      \"réunion sociale\": 0.2,\n      \"week-end en ville\": 0.1\n   }\n}', -0.46922, -0.12976, 76.3826),
(275, '3987376865359', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/douglas-jodhpur-boots-suede', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Douglas Jodhpur Boots - Suede - Men\'s', 'A versatile boot. The Douglas Jodhpurs will help you stand out from the crowd, while elevating the sophistication and versatility of your wardrobe. Despite their origins as an alternative to knee-high riding boots, owning a horse is no longer necessary to sport them. With their sleek silhouette and convenient strap and buckle at the ankle, these boots will pair flawlessly with a smart casual suit or your favorite pair of jeans. This product is made from luxurious suede sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 269.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/products/color_brown_1_douglas_jodhpur_boot_suede.jpg?v=1762198214', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Suede', 'TPU', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Chausses en suede', 1, 76.3684, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Ethan Thompson\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": 0.8,\n      \"independent\": 0.7,\n      \"conscientieux\": 0.9,\n      \"appreciate la qualité\": 0.95\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": {\n         \"frequente\": 0.6,\n         \"formel\": 0.4\n      },\n      \"sortie\": {\n         \"soirée\": 0.8,\n         \"week-end\": 0.7\n      },\n      \"loisirs\": {\n         \"activités de plein air\": 0.5,\n         \"shopping\": 0.3\n      }\n   }\n}', -0.0549763, -0.3118, 76.3826),
(276, '7322560069818', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/toledo-chukka-sneakers-pull-up', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Toledo Chukka Sneakers - Pull-Up - Men\'s', 'A perfect pair . With the Toledo Chukka Sneakers in robust pull-up leather, you get the best of what a chukka boot and a sneaker have to offer. The wide, almost sculptural quarters and ankle-length shaft of the chukka pair beautifully with the resilient rubber soles and relaxed appeal of sneakers. Wear them with shorts, jeans, and your more casual pants for a dynamic look that sets you apart from the crowd . This product is made from robust pull-up leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 179.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_brown_1_toledo_chukka_sneakers_pull_up.jpg?v=1762300401', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Pull-Up', 'Caoutchouc', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Chausses en cuir', 1, 81.1053, 2, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Ethan Thompson\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"confiant\",\n      \"independent\",\n      \"styleur\",\n      \"actif\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"sorties nocturnes\",\n      \"rendez-vous\",\n      \"week-ends en ville\",\n      \"événements sportifs\"\n   ]\n}', 0.0532551, -0.376944, 81.0924),
(277, '7322551550138', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/toledo-chukka-sneakers-nubuck', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Toledo Chukka Sneakers - Nubuck - Men\'s', 'Unique and attractive sneakers . Chukka boots are often worn due to their ease and comfort. So are sneakers, right? So it made sense to us to combine the two styles into the Toledo Chukka Sneakers, an incredible shoe that fits like a glove, supports you for hours on end, and looks amazing in velvety nubuck leather. The unmistakable chukka profile with an ankle length height, three eyelets and a wide open lacing system paired with a solid, reliant, rubber sneaker sole create a unique and attractive profile . This product is made from supply and sultry nubuck leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 179.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_browngum_1_toledo_chukka_sneakers_nubuck_8cee786a-d8d6-4448-97fd-0d34467fd8ee.jpg?v=1756325757', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Nubuck', 'Caoutchouc', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Chausses en nubuck', 1, 81.1053, 2, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": 0.8,\n      \"independant\": 0.9,\n      \"conformiste\": 0.2,\n      \"éclectique\": 0.7,\n      \"prévisible\": 0.6\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": 0.4,\n      \"sortie nocturne\": 0.3,\n      \"loisirs\": 0.2,\n      \"réunion professionnelle\": 0.1\n   }\n}', 0.0993348, -0.394453, 81.0924);
INSERT INTO `products` (`product_id`, `external_product_id`, `shop_id`, `product_url`, `category`, `subcategory`, `brand`, `product_name`, `description_raw`, `current_price`, `currency`, `rating_avg`, `reviews_count`, `stock_status`, `image_url_main`, `scraped_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `material`, `sole_type`, `closure`, `gender`, `short_description`, `is_enriched`, `ml_score`, `cluster_id`, `persona_json`, `pca_x`, `pca_y`, `predicted_success`) VALUES
(278, '7322518421690', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/graham-trainers-pull-up', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Graham Trainers - Pull-Up - Men\'s', 'Robust trainers. Graham Trainers in pull-up leather are a reliable and comfortable choice for when you\'re kicking back or running around town. The pull-up leather creates a solid and flexible structure. Add to that the temperature-regulating Vachetta leather and shock-absorbing, lightweight and abrasion-resistant dual-density EVA soles, and you’ve got a powerhouse trainer that even professional shoemakers would love to wear. This product is made with full-grain calfskin leather and water-repellent suede sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 179.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_brown_1_graham_trainers_pull_up.jpg?v=1762300397', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Caoutchouc', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Trainers en cuir', 1, 81.1053, 2, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": {\n      \"activite physique\": \"regular\",\n      \"loisirs\": \"sport, musique, voyage\"\n   },\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": true,\n      \"confiant\": true,\n      \"pratique\": true\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": \"occasionnel\",\n      \"sortie nocturne\": \"fréquent\",\n      \"sport\": \"fréquent\"\n   }\n}', 0.460434, -0.413131, 81.0924),
(279, '7030153740474', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/silva-boots-pull-up', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Silva Boots - Pull-Up - Men\'s', 'A reimagined waterproof boot. The Silva Boots in rugged pull-up leather will make you forget all the heavy, clunky and smothering waterproof boots out there. Functional and fashionable, the Silvas are constructed on the Denver last to give you a more natural, roomy fit and reduce pressure points. The rounded toe box, waterproof membrane lining, dual-density memory foam insoles, waterproof elastic side gussets, and lightweight, wear-resistant rubber soles work together to provide the ultimate in comfort and protection all year long. This product is made from robust pull-up leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 299.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/products/color_brown_1_silva_boots_pull_up.jpg?v=1762288577', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Pull-Up', 'Caoutchouc', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Chausses en cuir', 1, 74.7895, 2, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Ethan Thompson\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain actif\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"ambitieux\",\n      \"independent\",\n      \"passionné par la mode\",\n      \"appreciate la qualité\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"sorties nocturnes\",\n      \"voyages d\'affaires\",\n      \"activités de plein air\",\n      \"rendez-vous professionnels\"\n   ]\n}', 0.0532551, -0.376944, 74.804),
(280, '7030124839098', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/eriksen-loafers', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Eriksen Loafers - Men\'s', 'Smoothly elegant loafers. The profile of the Eriksen Loafer is raised with this edition in supple, full-grain calfskin leather.  Smooth and elegant, you’ll love the way they look and feel the moment you put them on. They’ll also age beautifully while taking on a special patina over time. With a dressier design and build than our traditional horse-bit loafers, the Eriksen favors suits, nice trousers and chinos. But you can wear them comfortably with jeans and relaxed pants if that’s more your style. This product is made from full-grain calfskin leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/products/color_black_1_eriksen_loafers.jpg?v=1762288570', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Cuir', 'Slip-on', 'homme', 'Loafers en cuir', 1, 77.9474, 3, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre Dubois\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-50\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": true,\n      \"discernant\": true,\n      \"appreciate la qualité\": true,\n      \"préoccupé par son image\": true,\n      \"préfère les marques de luxe\": true\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": true,\n      \"sorties nocturnes\": true,\n      \"réunions professionnelles\": true,\n      \"rendez-vous amoureux\": true\n   }\n}', -0.275659, 0.28704, 77.9539),
(281, '7030080209082', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/cohen-loafers-suede', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Cohen Loafers - Suede - Men\'s', 'Sharp and stylish. The appeal of the classic Cohen Loafers is heightened with this fresh edition in naturally water-repellent suede. The slender profile takes on a deep, rich quality, and the subtle stitching details add an interesting visual note to the overall aesthetic. Perfect for relaxed yet dressy looks, these sharp loafers are a great alternative to other casual shoe styles. This product is made from naturally water-repellent suede sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/products/color_brown_1_cohen_loafers_suede.jpg?v=1762288556', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Suede', 'Leather', 'Slip-on', 'homme', 'Chaussures de luxe pour homme', 1, 77.9474, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre Dupont\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": {\n      \"activite\": \"urbain\",\n      \"loisirs\": [\"musique\", \"cinéma\", \"dîner avec des amis\"],\n      \"valeur\": [\"qualité\", \"durabilité\", \"élégance\"]\n   },\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"confiance\": \"élevée\",\n      \"ouverture\": \"moyenne\",\n      \"sensibilité\": \"élevée\",\n      \"ambition\": \"élevée\"\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"lieu\": \"centre-ville, restaurants, événements\",\n      \"heure\": \"soirée, week-end\",\n      \"activité\": \"rendez-vous, sortie avec des amis\"\n   }\n}', -0.622729, -0.151243, 77.9539),
(282, '6768339321018', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/eriksen-loafers-pebbled', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Eriksen Loafers - Pebbled - Men\'s', 'Dressy and elegant. While honoring their heritage, the Eriksens elevate the classic horsebit loafer with their intriguing, textured pebbled leather upper and thicker leather sole. An elegant profile and subtle snaffle bit makes them well-suited for business casual wear, a fine dinner or an important event. The Eriksens can also relax with a pair of jeans or chinos on those days you want to take it easy. This product is made from full-grain calfskin leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/products/color_black_1_eriksen_loafers_pebbled.jpg?v=1762271814', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Pebbled Leather', 'Leather', 'Slip-on', 'homme', 'Chaussures de luxe pour homme', 1, 77.9474, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre Dupont\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": true,\n      \"discriminant\": true,\n      \"appreciateur de la qualité\": true,\n      \"préoccupé par son apparence\": true,\n      \"attaché à la tradition\": true\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": true,\n      \"sorties nocturnes\": true,\n      \"rendez-vous amicaux\": true,\n      \"week-end en ville\": true\n   }\n}', -0.528493, -0.139532, 77.9539),
(283, '6551294247098', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/morgen-trainers-pull-up', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Morgen Trainers - Pull-Up - Men\'s', 'Hardy and supportive. Trainers are by nature a sturdy type of sneaker. Ready for the rough road, supportive and always comfortable, they’re great to wear when you’re relaxing, doing errands or running around town. You should expect not only style, but substance like what you get with the Morgen Trainers in hardy pull-up leather. The classic design elements, such as the signature over laying strips of leather and rounded toe are heightened when handcrafted out of this rugged yet pliant material. And they’ll develop an intriguing dimension as they take on the expected scuffs and scrapes. No matter how hard you travel, the natural gum sole provides excellent support, buoyancy and shock absorption. Overall, you can depend on these Morgen Trainers to last for many years and to become more comfortable every time you wear them.', 179.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_brown_1_morgen_trainers_pull_up_gum_sole.jpg?v=1762268548', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Pull-Up Leather', 'Leather', 'Slip-on', 'homme', 'Chaussures de luxe pour homme', 1, 81.1053, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"actif\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"ambitieux\",\n      \"confiant\",\n      \"independent\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"sortie avec les amis\",\n      \"rendez-vous galant\",\n      \"week-end en ville\"\n   ]\n}', -0.40703, -0.178617, 81.0924),
(284, '4822062694479', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/dowler-boots-pebbled-leather', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Dowler Boots - Pebbled Leather - Men\'s', 'A robust yet refined boot. A refined take on classic workwear, the Dowler Boots in cool pebbled leather give you an entirely modern look that will outlast trends. Solidly constructed, wearing a pair gives you a sense of protection without the heaviness you find with similar boots. Over time the leather will start to conform to the shape of your feet and develop a warm patina. When you want the robustness of a boot with a refined profile, these are the ones for you. This product is made from full-grain calfskin leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 269.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/products/color_black_1_dowler_boots_pebbled_jpg.jpg?v=1762198640', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-03-24 16:34:33', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Pebbled Leather', 'Leather', 'Slip-on', 'homme', 'Chaussures de luxe pour homme', 1, 76.3684, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexander\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": 8,\n      \"confiant\": 7,\n      \"independent\": 9,\n      \"soigneux\": 8,\n      \"prévisible\": 6\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": 9,\n      \"sortie nocturne\": 8,\n      \"réunion professionnelle\": 9,\n      \"rendez-vous amical\": 7,\n      \"activités de loisirs\": 6\n   }\n}', -0.528493, -0.139532, 76.3826),
(285, '3941990203471', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/reyes-oxfords', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Reyes Oxfords - Men\'s', 'Display a great sense of style. Only the most experienced artisans can even attempt to create a shoe like the Reyes. Getting the punching, pinking and placement of all the elements just right takes a lot of skill and patience. All that work is done so you can look your best when wearing these shoes with a tailored suit, dressy chinos or nice jeans. This product is made from full-grain calfskin leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/products/color_black_1_reyes_oxfords.jpg?v=1762198157', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Full-grain Calfskin Leather', 'Leather', 'Slip-on', 'homme', 'Chaussures de luxe pour homme', 1, 77.9474, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Ethan Thompson\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain sophistiqué\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"confiant\",\n      \"independent\",\n      \"appreciate la qualité\",\n      \"préoccupé par l\'élégance\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"rendez-vous professionnels\",\n      \"sorties nocturnes\",\n      \"week-ends en ville\",\n      \"réunions avec des amis\"\n   ]\n}', -0.455999, -0.190876, 77.9539),
(286, '3959945953359', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/preston-chelseas-boots', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Preston Chelsea Boots - Men\'s', 'An effortless boot. The Preston Chelsea Boots take the guesswork out of dressing. Easy on the feet, and on the eyes, they complement dressy and casual looks effortlessly. The solid construction, flexible elastic side gussets and leather sole provide excellent support and comfort from day one. Slip them on and you\'re good to go. This product is made from full-grain calfskin leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 269.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/products/color_black_1_preston_chelseas_boots.jpg?v=1762198189', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Full-grain Calfskin Leather', 'Leather', 'Slip-on', 'homme', 'Chaussures de luxe pour homme', 1, 76.3684, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Ethan Thompson\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambition\": 8,\n      \"conformisme\": 6,\n      \"originalité\": 7,\n      \"prévisibilité\": 9,\n      \"sensibilité\": 5\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": 8,\n      \"sorties nocturnes\": 9,\n      \"réunions professionnelles\": 8,\n      \"événements sociaux\": 7,\n      \"loisirs\": 6\n   }\n}', -0.455999, -0.190876, 76.3826),
(287, '3959893819471', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/lopez-boots', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Lopez Boots - Men\'s', 'A boot for work and play. Rooted in their WWI Service Boot heritage, the Lopez boots have been refined to reflect the aesthetic of today’s gentlemen. Trademarks of their origins as a service boot still standout: a classic plain-toe, seven eyelets and an ankle-length shaft. The Lopez boots have been modernized with hand-polished full-grain leather, clean lines and double layered soles. They look fantastic with denim, chinos, flannels, and even a casual suit. This product is made from full-grain calfskin leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 269.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/products/color_black_1_lopez_boots.jpg?v=1762198187', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Full-grain Leather', 'Leather', 'Slip-on', 'homme', 'Chaussures de luxe pour homme', 1, 76.3684, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre\",\n   \"age_cible\": {\n      \"min\": 25,\n      \"max\": 45\n   },\n   \"style_vie\": {\n      \"activite\": \"urbaine\",\n      \"loisirs\": [\"musique\", \"cinéma\", \"voyages\"],\n      \"mode_de_vie\": \"urbain\"\n   },\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"confiance\": \"élevée\",\n      \"independance\": \"forte\",\n      \"sensibilité\": \"moyenne\"\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"journee_travail\": \"occasionnel\",\n      \"sortie_nuit\": \"frequente\",\n      \"événement\": \"occasionnel\"\n   }\n}', -0.454003, -0.174813, 76.3826),
(288, '3949954007119', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/irvine-derbies', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Irvine Derbies - Men\'s', 'Walk with confidence. While honoring the Derby’s workaday roots, the absence of ornamentation and addition of a leather sole, elevate the Irvines to the realm of formal wear. Every detail of the upper is impeccable, from the almond-shaped toe to the heel box. Although the profile is sleek, the interior volume will give you a comfortable fit all day long. This product is made from full-grain calfskin leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/products/color_black_1_irvine_derby.jpg?v=1762198164', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Full-grain Calfskin Leather', 'Leather', 'Slip-on', 'homme', 'Chaussures de luxe pour homme', 1, 77.9474, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Ethan Thompson\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain actif\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"ambitieux\",\n      \"independent\",\n      \"style\",\n      \"préoccupé par la qualité\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"rendez-vous\",\n      \"sortie avec des amis\",\n      \"événement social\",\n      \"jour de travail\"\n   ]\n}', -0.455999, -0.190876, 77.9539),
(289, '3959799709775', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/gallagher-boots', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Gallagher Boots - Men\'s', 'A boot for all occasions. A versatile pair of boots are always a must, no matter the season. Up your style with the rugged yet refined Gallagher boots. These exceptionally comfortable boots made with full-grain Italian leather, look great with both formal and casual wear, and will stand the test of time. This product is made from full-grain calfskin leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 269.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/products/color_black_1_gallagher_boots.jpg?v=1762198184', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Full-grain Calfskin Leather', 'Leather', 'Slip-on', 'homme', 'Chaussures de luxe pour homme', 1, 76.3684, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Ethan Thompson\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-55\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain, actif, professionnel\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"confiance\": 8,\n      \"independance\": 9,\n      \"élégance\": 7,\n      \"prévisibilité\": 6\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": 40,\n      \"sortie nocturne\": 30,\n      \"week-end\": 60,\n      \"loisirs\": 50\n   }\n}', -0.455999, -0.190876, 76.3826),
(290, '4470155116623', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/ellis-chukka-boots', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Ellis Chukka Boots - Men\'s', 'A refined chukka boot. The Ellis Chukka, molded on our sleek Soho last, redefines what a Chukka boot can be. The sleek Ellis can be dressed up or dressed down depending on your mood. The lighter single layer leather sole is flexible and elegant, and the almond shaped toe adds a touch of formality. The Ellis can go from the office to an elegant dinner with no trouble at all. This product is made from full-grain calfskin leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 269.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/products/color_black_1_ellis_chukka_boots.jpg?v=1762198316', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Full-grain Calfskin Leather', 'Leather', 'Slip-on', 'homme', 'Chaussures de luxe pour homme', 1, 76.3684, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": true,\n      \"independent\": true,\n      \"appreciate la qualité\": true,\n      \"valeur la durabilité\": true,\n      \"préfère les couleurs neutres\": true\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": true,\n      \"sortie nocturne\": true,\n      \"week-end en ville\": true,\n      \"réunion professionnelle\": true\n   }\n}', -0.455999, -0.190876, 76.3826),
(291, '4517426692175', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/beaumont-loafers-suede', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Beaumont Loafers - Suede - Men\'s', 'A loafer with sizzle Horsebit loafers are one of the most iconic styles ever created. Water-repellent suede is one of the most desired materials. Put them together and you get a masterful creation. Handsome and versatile, these gorgeous loafers sizzle at casual functions and elegant occasions. They look amazing with jeans and trousers, and add panache to tailored suits. This product is made from luxurious suede sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/products/color_brown_1_beaumont_loafers_suede.jpg?v=1762198346', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Suede', 'Leather', 'Slip-on', 'homme', 'Chaouches de luxe pour homme', 1, 77.9474, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre Dupont\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": 8,\n      \"confiant\": 7,\n      \"independent\": 9,\n      \"soigneux\": 8,\n      \"éclectique\": 6\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": 8,\n      \"sortie nocturne\": 7,\n      \"réunion professionnelle\": 9,\n      \"rendez-vous amical\": 6,\n      \"week-end en ville\": 8\n   }\n}', -0.622729, -0.151243, 77.9539),
(292, '4517463982159', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/anders-split-toe-derbies-suede', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Anders Split Toe Derbies -  Suede - Men\'s', 'A distinct derby Split-toe derbies are one of the fine gentlemen of the shoe world. Well put together with exacting detail, they naturally showcase a unique character and authenticity. Even though they’re considered to be casual, the Anders are equally at home in elegant settings. When made with water-repellent suede, they’re even more irresistible and distinctive. This product is made from luxurious suede sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/products/color_brown_1_anders_split_toe_derbies_suede.jpg?v=1762198348', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Suede', 'Leather', 'Slip-on', 'homme', 'Chaouches de luxe pour homme', 1, 77.9474, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre Dupont\",\n   \"age_cible\": 35,\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": true,\n      \"soigneux\": true,\n      \"independent\": true,\n      \"appreciate la qualité\": true\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": true,\n      \"sortie nocturne\": true,\n      \"rendez-vous\": true,\n      \"week-end en ville\": true\n   }\n}', -0.622729, -0.151243, 77.9539),
(293, '4776572813391', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/rivera-trainers-full-grain-leather', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Rivera Trainers - Men\'s', 'Luxurious materials and exquisite detailing. Combining the vintage appeal of a German Army Trainer with contemporary styling, Rivera Sneakers are truly unique. Crafted with luxurious smooth calfskin leather, these sleek kicks are a touch retro and a touch fashion-forward. The exquisite detailing complements both casual and dressy outfits, so you’ll always look great sporting a pair.', 179.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_blackblack_1_rivera_trainers_leather.jpg?v=1762198601', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Luxurious Smooth Calfskin Leather', 'Leather', 'Slip-on', 'homme', 'Chaussures de luxe pour homme', 1, 81.1053, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Ethan Thompson\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain actif\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": 0.8,\n      \"confiant\": 0.7,\n      \"independent\": 0.9,\n      \"passionné\": 0.8,\n      \"pratique\": 0.6\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": 0.4,\n      \"sortie avec les amis\": 0.3,\n      \"date\": 0.2,\n      \"sport\": 0.1\n   }\n}', -0.404821, -0.180879, 81.0924),
(294, '4680738111567', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/rivera-trainers-leather-suede', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Rivera Trainers - Leather/Suede - Men\'s', 'Luxurious materials and exquisite detailing Combining the vintage appeal of a German Army Trainer with contemporary styling, Rivera Sneakers are truly unique. Crafted with luxurious smooth calfskin leather and textured suede, these sleek kicks are a touch retro and a touch fashion-forward. The exquisite detailing complements both casual and dressy outfits, so you’ll always look great sporting a pair.', 179.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_blackblack_1_rivera_sneakers.jpg?v=1759253453', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Luxurious Smooth Calfskin Leather and Textured Suede', 'Leather', 'Slip-on', 'homme', 'Chaussures de luxe pour homme', 1, 81.1053, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Ethan Thompson\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"confiant\",\n      \"indépendant\",\n      \"appreciate la qualité\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"sorties nocturnes\",\n      \"rendez-vous\",\n      \"week-ends en ville\"\n   ]\n}', -0.409228, -0.22598, 81.0924),
(295, '4326093586511', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/garcia-sneakers-leather-suede', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Garcia Sneakers - Leather/Suede - Men\'s', 'At once retro and modern. Subtle elegance meets retro appeal in the Garcia Sneakers. Well-placed geometrical details bring the sleek profile to life, while neat rows of hand-punched perforation on the toe-box add cool visual appeal, and extra breathability. The Garcias will punch-up your sneaker game day and night. This product is made from full-grain calfskin leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 179.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_blackblack_1_garcia_sneakers_leather_suede_85f5405f-7d1f-4947-8f52-e8275f46692d.jpg?v=1759252729', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Full-grain Calfskin Leather', 'Leather', 'Slip-on', 'homme', 'Chaussures de luxe pour homme', 1, 81.1053, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre Dupont\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain, sophistiqué, actif\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"confiance\": 8,\n      \"originalité\": 7,\n      \"prévisibilité\": 6,\n      \"authenticité\": 9\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"jour\": \"soirée, travail, sortie avec amis\",\n      \"nuit\": \"sortie avec amis, événement, soirée\"\n   }\n}', -0.455999, -0.190876, 81.0924),
(296, '3986748932175', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/beaumont-horsebit-loafers', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Beaumont Loafers - Men\'s', 'A casual yet elegant loafer. Beaumont Loafers easily straddle the worlds of high style and casual wear. Created with true moccasin construction, every needle hole is punched, and every stitch on the apron is executed by the hand of a master. The result is a loafer that feels like no other shoe you will ever own with a graceful profile that contours your feet while making a bold statement. The Beaumonts sit comfortably under tailored suits and are relaxed enough to pair well with nice chinos, jeans and trousers. This product is made from full-grain calfskin leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/products/color_black_1_beaumont_horsebit_loafer.jpg?v=1762198212', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'True Moccasin Construction', 'Leather', 'Slip-on', 'homme', 'Chaouches de luxe pour homme', 1, 77.9474, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre Dupont\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-50\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"confiant\",\n      \"independent\",\n      \"appreciate la qualité\",\n      \"valeur la durabilité\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"rendez-vous professionnels\",\n      \"sorties nocturnes\",\n      \"week-ends en ville\",\n      \"voyages d\'affaires\"\n   ]\n}', -0.433346, -0.104768, 77.9539),
(297, '3959646355535', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/bolton-chelsea-boots', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Bolton Chelsea Boots - Men\'s', 'Sleek and sophisticated boots. These might be the most comfortable and convenient boots you’ll ever own. Elastic side gussets keep your feet in place, and will never deform or lose shape. The slightly elongated shaft and tapered waist fit comfortably under most suit pants and slim fit trousers. Cool curves and an eye-catching profile give the Boltons a distinct quality. This product is made from full-grain calfskin leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 269.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/products/color_black_1_bolton_chelsea_boots.jpg?v=1762198180', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Full-grain Calfskin Leather', 'Leather', 'Slip-on', 'homme', 'Chaussures de luxe pour homme', 1, 76.3684, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Ethan Thompson\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": true,\n      \"conscient de l\'apparence\": true,\n      \"préoccupé par la qualité\": true,\n      \"attaché à la mode\": true,\n      \"prévisible\": true\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": true,\n      \"sorties nocturnes\": true,\n      \"réunions professionnelles\": true,\n      \"week-end en ville\": true\n   }\n}', -0.455999, -0.190876, 76.3826),
(298, '3941928599631', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/cohen-loafers', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Cohen Loafers - Men\'s', 'Year-round loafers. The solid construction of the Cohen Loafers takes on the demands of a city street and the tranquility of a country road with ease. They are so easy to slip on and off, and cradle your feet in ultimate comfort they might as well be called “street slippers.” The leather saddle straddling the instep of a traditional loafer has been slimmed down to create an elongated and slender profile. And, the prominent stitching of the wholecut moccasin-style upper is set back to showcase an attractive almond-shaped toe. Cohen Loafers are extremely versatile and can be worn with nice suits, jeans, chinos and shorts (try them sockless). You may even end up adopting the Cohen Loafers as house-wear. This product is made from full-grain calfskin leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/products/color_black_1_cohen_loafers.jpg?v=1762198155', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Leather', 'Leather', 'Slip-on', 'homme', 'Chaouches de luxe pour homme', 1, 77.9474, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre Dupont\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"confiant\",\n      \"independent\",\n      \"appreciate la qualité\",\n      \"préoccupé par l\'apparence\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"rendez-vous professionnels\",\n      \"sorties nocturnes\",\n      \"voyages d\'affaires\",\n      \"journées de week-end\"\n   ]\n}', -0.528493, -0.139532, 77.9539),
(299, '4171532435535', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/garcia-sneakers', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Garcia Sneakers - Men\'s', 'All day luxury and support. The Garcia Sneakers provide you with a luxurious fit, all-day comfort and a gorgeous design. Perfect for quick jaunts, or extended wear, they will always support your feet, and the rest of your body for hours on end. Beautiful and casual with a lot of style, the Garcias might quickly become your everyday shoe. This product is made from full-grain calfskin leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 179.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_blackblack_1_garcia_sneakers_full_grain_38b32af8-bec7-474a-96d0-342230a63d28.jpg?v=1762198249', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Full-grain Calfskin Leather', 'Leather', 'Slip-on', 'homme', 'Chaussures de luxe pour homme', 1, 81.1053, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": {\n      \"activite\": \"sport\",\n      \"loisirs\": \"musique, voyage\"\n   },\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": true,\n      \"confiant\": true,\n      \"éclectique\": true\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"jardinage\": false,\n      \"cuisine\": false,\n      \"sortie nocturne\": true,\n      \"réunion professionnelle\": true\n   }\n}', -0.455999, -0.190876, 81.0924),
(300, '3986811060303', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/geller-trainers-1', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Geller Trainers - Suede - Men\'s', 'Superb quality and understated style. Wearing a pair of Geller Trainers is like slipping into a comfortable blanket. Soft, smooth and reassuring. Made from a wholecut piece of supple water-repellent suede, the absence of detailing or any accenting pieces makes these sneakers truly unique. You won’t miss any of that anyway as your feet enjoy a world of comfort and the bar is raised on what you should expect from a sneaker. This product is made from luxurious suede sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 179.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_bluegum_1_geller_trainers_suede.jpg?v=1759252637', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Water-repellent Suede', 'Leather', 'Slip-on', 'homme', 'Chaouches de luxe pour homme', 1, 81.1053, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Ethan Thompson\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": 0.8,\n      \"independent\": 0.7,\n      \"conformiste\": 0.2,\n      \"prévisiblement créatif\": 0.6\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": 0.4,\n      \"sortie en ville\": 0.3,\n      \"événement social\": 0.2,\n      \"loisirs\": 0.1\n   }\n}', -0.622729, -0.151243, 81.0924),
(301, '3969409122383', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/reid-sneakers', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Reid Sneakers - Men\'s', 'Always feel great. Minimalists believe things should be created with the highest quality materials and artistry, and stand the test of time. This line of thinking is beautifully displayed in our popular Reid Sneakers. Sleek, comfortable, and excellent quality, the Reids softly slide on and fit like a glove. Padded collars and removable inserts ensure they feel great no matter how or when you wear them. The simple yet sophisticated design of the Reid Sneakers make them perfect to wear with everything from shorts to suits. This product is made from full-grain calfskin leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 179.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/files/color_blackblack_1_reid_sneakers_full_grain_351fda12-8839-40d3-84a1-9b6eb76b6cc2.jpg?v=1756327211', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Gomme', 'Slip-on', 'homme', 'Sneakers confortables et de qualité', 1, 81.1053, 3, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Ethan Thompson\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-40\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain, actif, professionnel\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"confiant\",\n      \"independent\",\n      \"passionné par la mode\",\n      \"appreciate la qualité\",\n      \"prépare à investir dans des produits de marque\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"sorties avec les amis\",\n      \"rendez-vous professionnels\",\n      \"événements sportifs\",\n      \"voyages\",\n      \"journées de week-end\"\n   ]\n}', -0.296226, 0.575709, 81.0924),
(302, '3966993006671', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/roy-loafers-suede', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Roy Loafers - Suede - Men\'s', 'A new classic. Roy Loafers in water-repellent suede fulfill your need for a classic penny loafer with a more casual tone. The stunning profile, subtle details and solid structure of the Roys take on a new life when fashioned out of nappy, luxurious suede, which has been dyed to perfection in rich, earthy colors. Pair them with jeans, tweeds, wool and chinos for an always stylish look. This product is made from luxurious suede sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/products/color_brown_1_roy_loafers_suede.jpg?v=1762198197', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Toile', 'Gomme', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Loafers classiques en toile', 1, 77.9474, 1, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": {\n      \"activite\": \"urbaine\",\n      \"loisirs\": [\"musique\", \"cinéma\", \"lecture\"],\n      \"mode_de_vie\": \"urbain\"\n   },\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"values\": [\"qualité\", \"élégance\", \"originalité\"],\n      \"attitudes\": [\"independant\", \"confiant\", \"soigneux\"]\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"lieu\": [\"rendez-vous\", \"sortie\", \"réunion\"],\n      \"événement\": [\"anniversaire\", \"dîner\", \"soirée\"]\n   }\n}', 0.303358, 0.110112, 77.9539),
(303, '3966988419151', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/kent-wingtip', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Kent Wingtips - Men\'s', 'An exciting shoe for every day. The distinct design of the Kent Derbies help them stand-out from the rest. Attractive details like a cool wingtip, hand-punched broguing and chunky outsoles help to display your whimsical side. But, the solid construction and durable materials signal that you value quality and longevity too. The Kent Derbies look great with everything from a relaxed suit to jeans, and will elevate even the most basic look. This product is made from full-grain calfskin leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/products/color_black_1_kent_wingtip.jpg?v=1762198195', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Gomme', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Derbies avec détails de broderie', 1, 77.9474, 1, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Ethan Thompson\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"confiant\",\n      \"independent\",\n      \"appreciate la qualité\",\n      \"préoccupé par l\'élégance\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"rendez-vous professionnel\",\n      \"sorties nocturnes\",\n      \"week-ends en ville\",\n      \"voyages d\'affaires\"\n   ]\n}', 0.515126, 0.400522, 77.9539),
(304, '3959937171535', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/nolan-brogue-boots', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Nolan Brogue Boots - Men\'s', 'Knockout boots with lush detailing. Boots shouldn’t only protect you, they should wrap your feet in luxury - and Nolan Brogue Boots do both with precision. The upper, fashioned out of sturdy full-grain leather, is detailed with impressive ornamentation. Every hole of the broguing is precise, the placement of the swooping wingtip and pinking is exact. Fine points which really shine on these boots which exemplify how well form can meet function. It’s worth the effort to create a handsome and timeless boot you can wear with suits, chinos and cool jeans. This product is made from full-grain calfskin leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 269.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/products/color_tan_1_nolan_brogue_boots.jpg?v=1762198189', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Gomme', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Bottes avec détails de broderie', 1, 76.3684, 1, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Ethan Thompson\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"confiant\",\n      \"independent\",\n      \"appreciate la qualité\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"rendez-vous professionnels\",\n      \"sorties nocturnes\",\n      \"week-ends en ville\"\n   ]\n}', 0.515126, 0.400522, 76.3826),
(305, '3959762583631', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/easton-side-zip-boots', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Easton Side-Zip Boots - Men\'s', 'Daring yet distinguished boots. There’s nothing like a sleek pair of boots to help you step-up your style game. Tapered and contoured, the upper of the Easton Side-Zip Boots are a bit daring and always look amazing. The zipper is discreetly hidden by leather encasing to blend in with the rest of the boot, and the almond-shaped toe provides generous volume. The Eastons are a distinguished alternative to Chelseas, which makes them ideal to wear with finely tailored suits and sharp trousers. This product is made from full-grain calfskin leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 269.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/products/color_black_1_easton_side_zip.jpg?v=1762198182', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Gomme', 'Zip', 'homme', 'Bottes avec fermeture à glissière', 1, 76.3684, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Ethan Ryder\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"confiance\": 8,\n      \"independance\": 9,\n      \"sensibilité\": 6,\n      \"authenticité\": 8\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"jour\": {\n         \"travail\": 7,\n         \"sortie avec amis\": 5,\n         \"sortie romantique\": 3\n      },\n      \"soir\": {\n         \"sortie avec amis\": 8,\n         \"sortie romantique\": 6,\n         \"dîner en famille\": 4\n      }\n   }\n}', 0.0235344, 0.0851432, 76.3826);
INSERT INTO `products` (`product_id`, `external_product_id`, `shop_id`, `product_url`, `category`, `subcategory`, `brand`, `product_name`, `description_raw`, `current_price`, `currency`, `rating_avg`, `reviews_count`, `stock_status`, `image_url_main`, `scraped_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `material`, `sole_type`, `closure`, `gender`, `short_description`, `is_enriched`, `ml_score`, `cluster_id`, `persona_json`, `pca_x`, `pca_y`, `predicted_success`) VALUES
(306, '3950026195023', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/roy-loafers', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Roy Loafers - Men\'s', 'An updated classic loafer. Penny Loafers not only have to be attractive, they have to be practical. The Roy Loafers are both, and so much more. Taking their cue from the style that was a favorite of everyone from preppies to punks, the Roys bring the classic firmly into the 21st century with precise lines, immaculate stitching, a wide saddle and a pronounced vamp. They slip on and off with ease, and look amazing with shorts, casual or dressy pants, crisp linen and fitted jeans. So many choices for such a versatile shoe. This product is made from full-grain calfskin leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/products/color_black_1_roy_loafers.jpg?v=1762198166', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Gomme', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Loafers classiques', 1, 77.9474, 1, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Alexandre\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"confiant\",\n      \"independent\",\n      \"élégant\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"rendez-vous professionnel\",\n      \"sorties nocturnes\",\n      \"week-ends en ville\"\n   ]\n}', 0.515126, 0.400522, 77.9539),
(307, '3949917601871', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/grant-adelaide-oxfords', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Grant Adelaide Oxfords - Men\'s', 'A shoe with distinct character. With an understated elegance and sex appeal, the Grants break away from the traditional restrictions of other Oxfords to stand on their own. Crafted from a wholecut piece of full-grain leather, the hand brogued \'U\' shaped yoke around the lacestay adds a great deal of visual interest and an understated elegance to the entire shoe. This hard to find style has a “devil-may-care” attitude which gives them the freedom to work with tailored suits, tapered jeans, chinos and trousers. This product is made from full-grain calfskin leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/products/color_black_1_grant_adelaide_oxfords.jpg?v=1762198164', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Gomme', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Oxfords avec détails de broderie', 1, 77.9474, 1, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Ethan Thompson\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-45\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain élégant\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"confiant\",\n      \"independent\",\n      \"appreciate la qualité\",\n      \"valeur la durabilité\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"rendez-vous professionnels\",\n      \"sorties nocturnes\",\n      \"voyages d\'affaires\",\n      \"événements sociaux\"\n   ]\n}', 0.515126, 0.400522, 77.9539),
(308, '3942160597071', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/yates-oxford', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Yates Oxfords - Men\'s', 'Stylish shoes for any occasion. Starting off with a traditional Oxford design, the Yates Oxfords get to have some fun. Adorned with hand-punched broguing and pinking, the elaborate design makes a bold statement from the outset. The stunning medallion on the toe box, coupled with the perfectly executed wingtip that swoops away from the vamp and textural broguing throughout, distinguishes the Yates not only from other Oxfords, but from all other styles. They can be dressed up or down effortlessly to provide a sophisticated look without being overly formal. The Yates Oxfords are ready for wherever, however and whenever you want to wear them. This product is made from full-grain calfskin leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/products/color_black_1_yates_oxford.jpg?v=1762198159', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Gomme', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Oxfords avec détails de broderie', 1, 77.9474, 1, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Ethan Thompson\",\n   \"age_cible\": {\n      \"min\": 25,\n      \"max\": 45\n   },\n   \"style_vie\": {\n      \"professionnel\": true,\n      \"réussi\": true,\n      \"urbain\": true,\n      \"actif\": true\n   },\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"confiant\": true,\n      \"independent\": true,\n      \"élégant\": true,\n      \"prévisible\": true\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": true,\n      \"réunion d\'affaires\": true,\n      \"sortie nocturne\": true,\n      \"événement social\": true\n   }\n}', 0.515126, 0.400522, 77.9539),
(309, '3942100861007', 4, 'https://www.beckettsimonon.com/products/wright-austerity-oxfords', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Beckett Simonon', 'Wright Austerity Oxfords - Men\'s', 'A unique shoe. Do you like shoes with a bit of ornamentation, but nothing too fanciful? The look of a wingtip, but not so much broguing? Just enough to pique interest and to set you apart from the crowd. If so, then the Wright Austerity Brogues fit the bill. With a clean wingtip pattern, the elegance of this style is elevated by subtle lines and lack of broguing. Wear them easily with a handsome suit, relaxed trousers, even jeans. They’ll have you moving and shaking with the best of them, while winking at tradition. This product is made from full-grain calfskin leather sourced from a Gold-Rated tannery based in Arzignano, Italy. Being the highest level of recognition awarded by the Leather Working Group, a Gold rating signifies the leather manufacturer meets the most stringent criteria and demonstrates a strong commitment to mitigating its environmental impact.', 239.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0175/8496/products/color_black_1_wright_austerity.jpg?v=1762198159', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-03-24 16:34:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'Gomme', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Oxfords avec détails de broderie', 1, 77.9474, 1, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Henry Thompson\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"35-50\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain, professionnel, sophistiqué\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"ambitieux\": 0.8,\n      \"discernant\": 0.9,\n      \"prévisible\": 0.7,\n      \"respectueux\": 0.8,\n      \"influencé par la mode\": 0.6\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"travail\": 0.4,\n      \"sortie en ville\": 0.3,\n      \"réunion professionnelle\": 0.2,\n      \"événement social\": 0.1\n   }\n}', 0.515126, 0.400522, 77.9539),
(310, '10330222625101', 15, 'https://www.fillingpieces.com/products/mondo-float-light-grey', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Filling Pieces', 'Mondo Float Light Grey', 'This is the lightweight evolution of our staple silhouette. The Mondo Float is a refined interpretation of the Mondo, crafted for exceptional comfort and effortless wear. This Light Grey version is constructed from panels of premium Italian suede, elevated by debossed nappa leather on the tongue and heel. It is grounded by an ultra-lightweight EVA sole, resulting in a sophisticated, responsive sneaker for any modern wardrobe.', 200.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1809/9621/files/SS26-Mondo_Float_Light_Grey-1.jpg?v=1764774633', '2026-03-24 16:35:34', '2026-03-24 16:35:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Toile', 'EVA', 'Slip-on', 'unisexe', 'Sneakers légères en toile', 1, 80, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Lena\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-35\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"Urban Chic\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"indépendante\",\n      \"tendance\",\n      \"éclectique\",\n      \"appreciative de la qualité\",\n      \"consciente de l\'environnement\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": [\n      \"sorties nocturnes\",\n      \"événements de mode\",\n      \"voyages\",\n      \"journées de shopping\",\n      \"rendez-vous amicaux\"\n   ]\n}', -0.345507, -0.0706033, 79.995),
(311, '10330224460109', 15, 'https://www.fillingpieces.com/products/loafer-panier-black', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Filling Pieces', 'Loafer Panier Black', 'This is a testament to artisanal heritage. The Loafer Panier is a true hero piece, defined by its custom-designed, ratan-engineered upper developed in collaboration with specialized Spanish ateliers. The intricate, woven upper is crafted on a microfiber base with special embroidery degrade thread. Finished in Portugal, this Black loafer is elevated with Polido leather trim and our custom hand-shake hardware.', 390.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'out_of_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1809/9621/files/Tshirt_Peper_Black_8.jpg?v=1770303058', '2026-03-24 16:35:34', '2026-03-24 16:35:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Toile', 'Gomme', 'Lacets', 'unisexe', 'Loafers en toile', 1, 70, 1, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Léa Dupont\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-35\",\n   \"style_vie\": \"urbain\",\n   \"traits_personnalite\": [\n      \"indépendante\",\n      \"créative\",\n      \"éclectique\",\n      \"appreciative de la qualité\"\n   ],\n   \"occasion_port\": \"tous les jours, en ville\"\n}', 0.303358, 0.110112, 70.1116),
(312, '10080535085389', 15, 'https://www.fillingpieces.com/products/mondo-viera-all-white', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Filling Pieces', 'Mondo Viera All White', 'The Mondo Viera introduces a new rhythm to our classic silhouette, featuring a wider, rounder toe shape for enhanced comfort. Crafted in a monochromatic \'All White\', the design creates a harmonious look by contrasting panels of smooth nappa with soft, hairy suede. Built on our new Riviera cupsole with a Gowtu knot monogram, this shoe is a versatile expression of the \'United by Rhythm\' collection.', 220.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'out_of_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1809/9621/files/8720133506393-1.jpg?v=1755004288', '2026-03-24 16:35:34', '2026-03-24 16:35:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Toile', 'Gomme', 'Lacets', 'unisexe', 'Sneakers en toile', 1, 78.9474, 1, '{\n  \"propos\": [\n      {\n         \"nom_persona\": \"Lena\",\n         \"prenom_persona\": \"Léa\",\n         \"age_cible\": \"25-35\",\n         \"style_vie\": \"urbain\",\n         \"traits_personnalite\": {\n            \"confident\": 8,\n            \"independant\": 9,\n            \"éclectique\": 7,\n            \"tendance\": 6,\n            \"élégant\": 8\n         },\n         \"occasion_port\": {\n            \"journee_travail\": \"foulard\",\n            \"soirée\": \"robe\",\n            \"week-end\": \"tenue sportive\",\n            \"sortie avec amis\": \"robe\"\n         }\n      },\n      {\n         \"nom_persona\": \"Sofia\",\n         \"prenom_persona\": \"Sara\",\n         \"age_cible\": \"28-38\",\n         \"style_vie\": \"urbain\",\n         \"traits_personnalite\": {\n            \"confident\": 9,\n            \"independant\": 8,\n            \"éclectique\": 8,\n            \"tendance\": 7,\n            \"élégant\": 9\n         },\n         \"occasion_port\": {\n            \"journee_travail\": \"foulard\",\n            \"soirée\": \"robe\",\n            \"week-end\": \"tenue sportive\",\n            \"sortie avec amis\": \"robe\"\n         }\n      },\n      {\n         \"nom_persona\": \"Aurélie\",\n         \"prenom_persona\": \"Auré\",\n         \"age_cible\": \"22-32\",\n         \"style_vie\": \"urbain\",\n         \"traits_personnalite\": {\n            \"confident\": 7,\n            \"independant\": 6,\n            \"éclectique\": 9,\n            \"tendance\": 8,\n            \"élégant\": 7\n         },\n         \"occasion_port\": {\n            \"journee_travail\": \"foulard\",\n            \"soirée\": \"robe\",\n            \"week-end\": \"tenue sportive\",\n            \"sortie avec amis\": \"robe\"\n         }\n      }\n   ]\n}', 0.303358, 0.110112, 78.9466),
(313, '10080536035661', 15, 'https://www.fillingpieces.com/products/cruiser-dive-grey', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Filling Pieces', 'Cruiser Dive Grey', 'Crafted in a refined palette of cool grey, the Cruiser presents a masterclass in understated luxury. Supple nubuck elegantly contrasts with a multi-dimensional mesh, creating a subtle interplay of textures. The design is animated by a unique lenticular effect—a quiet detail that captures the eye upon closer inspection. Engineered for effortless comfort, this trainer offers a clean, modern silhouette that seamlessly elevates your essential wardrobe.', 240.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'in_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1809/9621/files/8720133595045-1.jpg?v=1754491697', '2026-03-24 16:35:34', '2026-03-24 16:35:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Toile', 'Gomme', 'Slip-on', 'unisexe', 'Sneakers en toile', 1, 77.8947, 3, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Lena\",\n   \"age_cible\": {\n      \"min\": 25,\n      \"max\": 40\n   },\n   \"style_vie\": {\n      \"urban\": 0.6,\n      \"bohème\": 0.2,\n      \"éthique\": 0.2\n   },\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"independante\": 0.8,\n      \"confiante\": 0.7,\n      \"éclectique\": 0.9\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"journée de travail\": 0.4,\n      \"sortie avec des amis\": 0.3,\n      \"week-end en ville\": 0.3\n   }\n}', -0.333739, 0.315283, 77.9058),
(314, '10080538034509', 15, 'https://www.fillingpieces.com/products/bulky-derby-black', 'Shoes', 'Sneakers', 'Filling Pieces', 'Bulky Derby Black', 'Introducing a more robust and rounded derby, the Bulky Derby Black stands on a new custom-designed sole. This modern silhouette is crafted from fine Polido black leather, and features a subtle mini gowtu embossed knot on the toe box for a touch of refined detail. The shoe is built for comfort with a lightweight EVA sole and a soft, breathable mesh lining, creating a harmonious blend of style and wearability.', 280.00, 'AED', NULL, 0, 'out_of_stock', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1809/9621/files/8720133503149_2.jpg?v=1759398842', '2026-03-24 16:35:34', '2026-03-24 16:35:34', '2026-04-16 20:28:53', 'Cuir', 'EVA', 'Lacets', 'homme', 'Derbies en cuir', 1, 75.7895, 4, '{\n  \"nom_persona\": \"Liam\",\n   \"age_cible\": \"25-35\",\n   \"style_vie\": {\n      \"activite\": \"urbain\",\n      \"loisirs\": [\"musique\", \"cinéma\", \"sorties\"],\n      \"mode_de_vie\": \"urbain\",\n      \"niveau_de_vie\": \"moyen\"\n   },\n   \"traits_personnalite\": {\n      \"confiance\": \"élevé\",\n      \"ouverture\": \"moyen\",\n      \"sensibilité\": \"élevé\",\n      \"independance\": \"élevé\"\n   },\n   \"occasion_port\": {\n      \"occasion\": \"soirée\",\n      \"événement\": \"festival\",\n      \"lieu\": \"ville\",\n      \"activité\": \"sortie\"\n   }\n}', 0.102165, -0.132205, 75.8073),
